# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-06-19 01:12

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:10
translate ptbr carltuesday_d9f7fdd8:

    # "Turns out it was a good idea to hang out with Carl today."
    "Acontece que foi uma boa ideia dar um rolê com o Carl hoje."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:12
translate ptbr carltuesday_d3675dfb:

    # "After texting back and forth with Leo I learn that he's actually planning a birthday party for the ram."
    "Depois de trocar umas mensagens com o Leo, fico sabendo que ele tá, na verdade, planejando uma festa de aniversário pro carneiro."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:13
translate ptbr carltuesday_6d5efaa0:

    # "It's a little weird since Carl's birthday isn't for another month, but I guess it's just an excuse to have a party."
    "É um pouco estranho já que o aniversário do Carl só vai ser daqui a um mês, mas acho que é só uma desculpa pra dar uma festa."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:14
translate ptbr carltuesday_38352706:

    # "Leo tells me to keep Carl distracted for the day while they go shopping for decorations and gifts."
    "O Leo me manda manter o Carl distraído o dia todo enquanto eles vão comprar decorações e presentes."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:15
translate ptbr carltuesday_663567f5:

    # "He also tells me he'll get my gift for Carl, which is fine with me."
    "Ele também diz que vai comprar o meu presente pro Carl, o que por mim tudo bem."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:16
translate ptbr carltuesday_8ac89ae6:

    # "TJ's pretty bummed, though, considering it throws off his hiking plans, but Jenna promises him they'll at least hike half the trail."
    "O TJ tá bem chateado, no entanto, considerando que isso atrapalha os planos dele de fazer trilha, mas a Jenna promete pra ele que vão fazer pelo menos metade do percurso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:17
translate ptbr carltuesday_962416aa:

    # "I want to talk to him, but he's acting pretty cold towards me, probably because I'm bailing on my promise to go with him."
    "Eu queria falar com ele, mas ele tá agindo meio frio comigo, provavelmente porque eu tô furando a minha promessa de ir com ele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:21
translate ptbr carltuesday_5bd2dc2f:

    # "I drive to Carl's house because it's pretty far separated from the rest of Echo, up against the foothills of the Casa Demonio mountain range."
    "Eu dirijo até a casa do Carl porque ela fica bem afastada do resto de Echo, lá em cima, na base da cordilheira da Casa Demonio."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:22
translate ptbr carltuesday_f4e256d9:

    # "It'd probably take me fifteen minutes to get up there, and there's no way in hell I'm doing that, in this heat, uphill, when I've got a car."
    "Provavelmente levaria uns quinze minutos pra subir até lá, e não tem a menor chance de eu fazer isso a pé, nesse calor, ladeira acima, quando eu tenho um carro."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:23
translate ptbr carltuesday_76a8be3a:

    # "The main reason it's separated like this is because Carl's house is a mansion."
    "O motivo principal de ser afastada assim é porque a casa do Carl é uma mansão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:24
translate ptbr carltuesday_ab930019:

    # "Carl's family is loaded. A legacy that's followed them ever since Carl's great-great-whatever struck it rich over a hundred years ago."
    "A família do Carl é podre de rica. Um legado que acompanha eles desde que o tataravô-alguma-coisa dele ficou rico há mais de cem anos."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:25
translate ptbr carltuesday_09aa558e:

    # "James Hendricks eventually went on to start an ice cream business which, at this point, has spread out over most of the Western half of the country."
    "O James Hendricks acabou fundando um negócio de sorvetes que, a essa altura, se espalhou por quase toda a metade ocidental do país."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:26
translate ptbr carltuesday_282e197c:

    # "Carl's mom is the CEO, I think."
    "A mãe do Carl é a CEO, eu acho."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:27
translate ptbr carltuesday_a0661ecf:

    # "Actually, now that I'm thinking about it, I should probably get some shots of the mansion considering its role in the town's history."
    "Na verdade, agora que tô pensando nisso, eu provavelmente deveria tirar umas fotos da mansão considerando o papel dela na história da cidade."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:28
translate ptbr carltuesday_7af37fcc:

    # "Most of the old mansion has been demolished at this point, but I think parts of it are still from the original structure."
    "A maior parte da velha mansão já foi demolida a essa altura, mas acho que algumas partes ainda são da estrutura original."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:29
translate ptbr carltuesday_591f4d06:

    # "Probably best to ask first, though."
    "Provavelmente é melhor perguntar primeiro, no entanto."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:30
translate ptbr carltuesday_1f496f97:

    # "I walk up to the front door and ring the doorbell, listening to the fancy chime inside."
    "Eu caminho até a porta da frente e toco a campainha, ouvindo o toque chique lá dentro."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:31
translate ptbr carltuesday_d3bdab25:

    # "I wait for about a minute, starting to wonder if Carl is asleep, or just high off his ass, when I hear some voices from behind the house."
    "Espero por mais ou menos um minuto, começando a me perguntar se o Carl tá dormindo, ou só chapado pra caralho, quando ouço umas vozes vindo dos fundos da casa."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:32
translate ptbr carltuesday_6fcf020d:

    # "I'm definitely recognizing the crackly timbre of Carl's voice along with the high tenor of Flynn's."
    "Eu definitivamente reconheço o tom rouco da voz do Carl junto com o tenor agudo do Flynn."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:33
translate ptbr carltuesday_89214fcb:

    # "I head around the house, stepping carefully through the desert landscaping and walking into the backyard."
    "Eu dou a volta na casa, pisando com cuidado pelo jardim de estilo desértico e entrando no quintal dos fundos."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:36
translate ptbr carltuesday_34c3c2b8:

    # f "\"—'Cuz you wanna make out with him?\""
    f "\"—Por que você quer pegar ele?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:37
translate ptbr carltuesday_ce3c6a66:

    # c "\"No, because you like to make things weird. I just want it to be relaxed—\""
    c "\"Não, porque você gosta de deixar as coisas estranhas. Eu só quero que seja de boa—\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:40
translate ptbr carltuesday_b498ca96:

    # "That's when Carl notices me as I round the corner, clutching my camera bag to my side."
    "É aí que o Carl me nota enquanto eu viro a esquina, segurando minha bolsa da câmera de lado."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:44
translate ptbr carltuesday_e7b6c6f3:

    # "He's leaning over a bush with a giant set of clippers while Flynn lounges up against the wall, watching him."
    "Ele tá inclinado sobre um arbusto com uma tesoura de poda gigante, enquanto o Flynn tá largado contra a parede, observando ele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:46
translate ptbr carltuesday_10561f6e:

    # c "\"Whoa, Chase!\""
    c "\"Opa, Chase!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:50
translate ptbr carltuesday_15a83901:

    # "Carl's ears perk and he grins."
    "As orelhas do Carl se levantam e ele abre um sorriso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:52
translate ptbr carltuesday_200d032a:

    # c "\"Sorry, Flynn—\""
    c "\"Desculpa, o Flynn—\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:53
translate ptbr carltuesday_5f406d8f:

    # "Carl rolls his big head at the lizard."
    "O Carl vira a cabeçorra dele pro lagarto."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:54
translate ptbr carltuesday_74cd00ce:

    # c "\"—was supposed to be watching for you.\""
    c "\"—devia tá de olho esperando você.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:55
translate ptbr carltuesday_8de97e69:

    # "Flynn doesn't look at me right away, instead choosing to pull the toothpick he's chewing on out of his muzzle to look at it."
    "O Flynn não olha pra mim logo de cara, em vez disso escolhe tirar o palito que tá mastigando do focinho pra ficar olhando pra ele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:56
translate ptbr carltuesday_425aa806:

    # "He's still embarrassed about yesterday."
    "Ele ainda tá com vergonha de ontem."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:57
translate ptbr carltuesday_c5fa6fdf:

    # "Good."
    "Que bom."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:58
translate ptbr carltuesday_ff7d3857:

    # m "\"That's alright. Wasn't hard to hear you guys from the front.\""
    m "\"Tudo bem. Não foi difícil ouvir vocês da frente.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:60
translate ptbr carltuesday_9cd7978f:

    # c "\"Yeah, uh, just doing some yard work...obviously.\""
    c "\"É, hã, só fazendo um serviço no quintal... obviamente.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:61
translate ptbr carltuesday_399dd478:

    # "He rubs behind his head."
    "Ele esfrega atrás da cabeça."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:62
translate ptbr carltuesday_a6c19599:

    # c "\"Promised my parents I'd get this done before they got back.\""
    c "\"Prometi pros meus pais que faria isso antes deles voltarem.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:63
translate ptbr carltuesday_c3a1ebc5:

    # "Carl starts snipping at the bush again."
    "O Carl começa a cortar o arbusto de novo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:64
translate ptbr carltuesday_0833de86:

    # "He's unusually sharp right now, I'm guessing because he hasn't had anything to smoke."
    "Ele tá estranhamente elétrico agora, imagino que seja porque ele não fumou nada."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:65
translate ptbr carltuesday_96230f44:

    # "Either way it's jarring to see him so animated."
    "De qualquer forma, é chocante ver ele tão animado."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:66
translate ptbr carltuesday_dc0f6fb6:

    # m "\"Well, looks like you're doing a good job.\""
    m "\"Bom, parece que você tá fazendo um bom trabalho.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:68
translate ptbr carltuesday_adc322ae:

    # f "\"Oh, he's only moving this fast because he wants to hang out with you, Chase.\""
    f "\"Ah, ele só tá sendo tão rápido assim porque ele quer passar um tempo com você, Chase.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:69
translate ptbr carltuesday_223473e8:

    # "Even though the sentence is technically being said to me, I feel like Flynn's directing it at Carl."
    "Mesmo a frase tecnicamente sendo dita pra mim, sinto que o Flynn tá direcionando pro Carl."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:71
translate ptbr carltuesday_865ecd3a:

    # "Carl furrows his brow."
    "O Carl franze a testa."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:72
translate ptbr carltuesday_88c218a1:

    # c "\"Chase, you can go inside if you want. The back is open.\""
    c "\"Chase, você pode entrar se quiser. A porta dos fundos tá aberta.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:73
translate ptbr carltuesday_8c9b8b2a:

    # "I think that's a good idea because it's clear now that I've walked in on an argument."
    "Acho que é uma boa ideia porque agora tá claro que eu cheguei no meio de uma discussão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:74
translate ptbr carltuesday_5f365bf0:

    # f "\"You should have seen him a few minutes ago; it was like he had a girlfriend comin' over.\""
    f "\"Você devia ter visto ele uns minutos atrás; parecia que a namorada dele vinha fazer uma visita.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:75
translate ptbr carltuesday_528dcd36:

    # "Carl sighs loudly and his snips start to get a bit more violent."
    "O Carl suspira alto e as tesouradas dele começam a ficar um pouco mais violentas."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:76
translate ptbr carltuesday_b4d1325d:

    # c "\"No, I'm just glad to have some company that isn't only you, Flynn.\""
    c "\"Não, eu só tô feliz em ter alguma companhia que não seja só você, Flynn.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:78
translate ptbr carltuesday_ca466946:

    # "Flynn looks annoyed and that annoys me."
    "O Flynn parece irritado e isso me irrita."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:79
translate ptbr carltuesday_1ffed36c:

    # "He really didn't have the right to be frustrated with anyone after yesterday."
    "Ele realmente não tinha o direito de ficar frustrado com ninguém depois de ontem."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:80
translate ptbr carltuesday_dd44647f:

    # f "\"Really? Always seemed to be enough for you in the past.\""
    f "\"Sério? Sempre pareceu o suficiente pra você no passado.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:82
translate ptbr carltuesday_4d641930:

    # "Flynn makes a kissy face."
    "O Flynn faz biquinho de beijo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:83
translate ptbr carltuesday_8bc00c53:

    # "I have no idea if this is one of their inside jokes, or not."
    "Eu não tenho ideia se isso é uma piada interna deles, ou não."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:84
translate ptbr carltuesday_a5212991:

    # "Carl stops snipping for a second, then starts up again, more slowly."
    "O Carl para de cortar por um segundo, e então recomeça, mais lentamente."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:86
translate ptbr carltuesday_03aa3350:

    # c "\"Well, you know, lizards can be fun, but they don't have ALL the parts that I like, if you know what I mean.\""
    c "\"Bom, você sabe, lagartos podem ser divertidos, mas eles não têm TODAS as partes que eu gosto, se é que me entende.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:87
translate ptbr carltuesday_9a3dd3e2:

    # "Carl smirks sideways at Flynn."
    "O Carl dá um sorriso de lado pro Flynn."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:88
translate ptbr carltuesday_da511b8f:

    # "Flynn sneers back and, though I've decided that they're still joking, there's definitely a growing tension between them."
    "O Flynn devolve o sorriso com desdém e, embora eu tenha decidido que eles ainda tão brincando, tem definitivamente uma tensão crescendo entre eles."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:89
translate ptbr carltuesday_55824610:

    # f "\"Wath'cha sayin' there, Carl?\""
    f "\"O que cê tá dizendo aí, Carl?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:90
translate ptbr carltuesday_e2ffaa11:

    # "Carl stops snipping and plants the point of the clippers into the ground, leaning on it as he turns to face Flynn."
    "O Carl para de cortar e planta a ponta da tesoura no chão, se apoiando nela ao se virar pra encarar o Flynn."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:91
translate ptbr carltuesday_607cfdb6:

    # c "\"What I'm saying is you've got no ba—\""
    c "\"O que eu tô dizendo é que você não tem bo—\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:93
translate ptbr carltuesday_818c6dd4:

    # "Before Carl can finish his sentence Flynn turns to the right, away from him."
    "Antes que o Carl possa terminar a frase, o Flynn se vira pra direita, pra longe dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:94
translate ptbr carltuesday_aa998d8c:

    # "This also brings his fat tail around to slam into Carl's crotch with a 'whap' that makes me cringe."
    "Isso também faz com que sua cauda gorda gire e bata bem no meio das pernas do Carl com um 'pá' que me faz encolher."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:101
translate ptbr carltuesday_76f3014d:

    # "Carl jumps, then squeaks, before toppling to the ground."
    "O Carl dá um pulo, depois dá um gritinho, antes de cair no chão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:102
translate ptbr carltuesday_45dbbaa4:

    # c "\"Oh man, my NUTS!\""
    c "\"Ai cara, minhas BOLAS!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:103
translate ptbr carltuesday_3c1f461c:

    # f "\"Yeah, definitely wish I had those; all dangly and vulnerable and shit. Anyway, I'll leave you two sluts alone.\""
    f "\"É, com certeza eu queria ter umas dessas; todas penduradas e vulneráveis e o caralho a quatro. Enfim, vou deixar vocês duas piranhas a sós.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:104
translate ptbr carltuesday_bc6559a8:

    # "Flynn sticks the toothpick back into his muzzle and I have to consciously try not to cover my crotch while he walks by me."
    "O Flynn bota o palito de volta no focinho e eu tenho que me esforçar muito pra não cobrir a minha virilha enquanto ele passa por mim."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:106
translate ptbr carltuesday_9c722619:

    # "He hasn't looked at me this whole time."
    "Ele não olhou pra mim esse tempo todo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:107
translate ptbr carltuesday_83b6391a:

    # "Once Flynn's gone I sidle up to Carl who's still curled up on the ground, holding himself while he mutters under his breath."
    "Assim que o Flynn vai embora, eu me aproximo do Carl, que ainda tá encolhido no chão, se segurando enquanto murmura alguma coisa pra si mesmo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:108
translate ptbr carltuesday_1c5f0949:

    # m "\"Uh, you alright?\""
    m "\"Hã, cê tá legal?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:109
translate ptbr carltuesday_99f408bf:

    # c "\"Fuuuuuck, no.\""
    c "\"Puuuuuta que pariu, não.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:110
translate ptbr carltuesday_511a7243:

    # m "\"Um...\""
    m "\"Hã...\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:111
translate ptbr carltuesday_1059bb5d:

    # "There's not really anything I can do, so I rub his shoulder with a toe comfortingly and he freezes up as I do, looking at my foot."
    "Não tem muito o que eu possa fazer, então esfrego o ombro dele com um dedo do pé de forma reconfortante e ele congela quando eu faço isso, olhando pro meu pé."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:112
translate ptbr carltuesday_5d182d77:

    # c "\"Uh, I'm alright, though.\""
    c "\"Hã, tô bem, já.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:113
translate ptbr carltuesday_53f10ce1:

    # "He gets himself into a sitting position before he gets up awkwardly, standing bow-legged."
    "Ele se senta antes de se levantar de um jeito desajeitado, de pernas abertas."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:114
translate ptbr carltuesday_7722fc59:

    # m "\"I forgot how much Flynn likes to hit people in the nuts.\""
    m "\"Eu tinha esquecido o quanto o Flynn gosta de bater nas bolas dos outros.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:116
translate ptbr carltuesday_c3873815:

    # c "\"I'll get him back. It still hurts him if you hit hard enough.\""
    c "\"Eu vou dar o troco. Ainda dói nele se você bater forte o suficiente.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:117
translate ptbr carltuesday_fd7049a6:

    # "As he stands there, doubled over with his paws on his knees, I look around."
    "Enquanto ele fica lá, dobrado com as patas nos joelhos, eu dou uma olhada em volta."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:118
translate ptbr carltuesday_1d59deeb:

    # "Carl's house has actual grass in the back, which is rare in Echo; most people either xeriscape or just let the sage brush take over."
    "A casa do Carl tem grama de verdade nos fundos, o que é raro em Echo; a maioria das pessoas faz xeropaisagismo ou simplesmente deixa o mato tomar conta."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:119
translate ptbr carltuesday_868ae650:

    # "Another rarity are the two tall trees on either side of the yard."
    "Outra raridade são as duas árvores altas de cada lado do quintal."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:120
translate ptbr carltuesday_038169a0:

    # "That's when I notice how empty one of them looks."
    "É aí que eu percebo como uma delas parece vazia."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:121
translate ptbr carltuesday_9a472968:

    # m "\"Hey, where'd the tree house go?\""
    m "\"Ei, onde foi parar a casa na árvore?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:123
translate ptbr carltuesday_97d765dc:

    # "Carl follows my gaze."
    "O Carl acompanha meu olhar."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:124
translate ptbr carltuesday_263c1575:

    # c "\"Oh yeah, my dad took it down a few years ago. It was falling apart.\""
    c "\"Ah é, meu pai derrubou faz uns anos. Ela já tava caindo aos pedaços.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:125
translate ptbr carltuesday_90febc33:

    # "His dad also built the tree house. I can remember hanging out up there, playing on our portable game consoles with a fan at full blast."
    "Foi o pai dele que construiu a casa na árvore, inclusive. Eu consigo lembrar da gente passando o tempo lá em cima, jogando nossos videogames portáteis com um ventilador ligado no máximo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:126
translate ptbr carltuesday_fcb8009a:

    # "Even then it was still almost too hot to hang out up there."
    "Mesmo assim ainda era quase quente demais pra ficar lá em cima."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:127
translate ptbr carltuesday_8cdcfbf3:

    # "I walk up to the base of the tree and put my hand against the trunk, grinning."
    "Eu vou até a base da árvore e coloco a mão no tronco, abrindo um sorriso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:128
translate ptbr carltuesday_a7b75a59:

    # m "\"Man, remember all the shit we did up there?\""
    m "\"Cara, lembra de todas as merdas que a gente fazia lá em cima?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:130
translate ptbr carltuesday_03ccd22d:

    # "Carl shuffles up next to me (still bowlegged) and grins, too."
    "O Carl se aproxima de mim arrastando os pés (ainda de pernas abertas) e sorri, também."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:131
translate ptbr carltuesday_150b65f3:

    # c "\"Yeah, good times.\""
    c "\"É, bons tempos.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:132
translate ptbr carltuesday_1999c5b0:

    # "I think about climbing it, but I notice that the branch we used to use as a foothold has been cut off."
    "Eu penso em subir na árvore, mas noto que o galho que a gente usava como apoio pro pé foi cortado."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:133
translate ptbr carltuesday_f4c0c47d:

    # m "\"Your dad ruined this thing.\""
    m "\"Teu pai estragou essa coisa.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:134
translate ptbr carltuesday_54c93c88:

    # "Carl scrapes at the spot where the branch used to be with a hoof."
    "O Carl raspa com o casco o lugar onde o galho costumava ficar."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:135
translate ptbr carltuesday_d8327cd2:

    # c "\"Yeah, I guess it made the mowing harder, and we didn't use it anymore, so he just cut it off.\""
    c "\"É, acho que isso dificultava pra cortar a grama, e a gente não usava mais mesmo, então ele só cortou fora.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:136
translate ptbr carltuesday_d6a82644:

    # "I can see Carl's looking for a way up, too, and soon enough his eyes settle on a branch just above his head."
    "Eu consigo ver que o Carl também tá procurando um jeito de subir, e logo os olhos dele param num galho logo acima da cabeça dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:137
translate ptbr carltuesday_24add6ee:

    # m "\"I don't know if—\""
    m "\"Eu não sei se—\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:138
translate ptbr carltuesday_37d20084:

    # "Carl's already jumping to grab onto the branch with both paws. It doesn't look very sturdy."
    "O Carl já tá pulando pra agarrar o galho com as duas patas. Não parece muito firme."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:139
translate ptbr carltuesday_981dd1a4:

    # m "\"Dude, that's gonna break.\""
    m "\"Cara, isso vai quebrar.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:140
translate ptbr carltuesday_50dfd92e:

    # c "\"So? I'm fucking fat; I'll bounce.\""
    c "\"E daí? Eu sou gordo pra caralho; eu vou quicar.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:142
translate ptbr carltuesday_5b8097ed:

    # "I'm about to tell him again that the branch is definitely going to break when I notice his shirt ridding up all the way over his round belly."
    "Eu tô prestes a dizer de novo que o galho definitivamente vai quebrar quando noto a camisa dele subindo até cobrir toda a barriga redonda dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:143
translate ptbr carltuesday_d0cff4b3:

    # "It's not like it's he's a bag of lard, though. It's a controlled type of gut, held tight with the muscles underneath pulling it in as he flexes."
    "Não é como se ele fosse um saco de banha, no entanto. É um tipo de pança controlada, mantida firme pelos músculos por baixo puxando ela pra dentro enquanto ele flexiona."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:144
translate ptbr carltuesday_b652a55c:

    # "He notices me staring right away and kicks out at me playfully."
    "Ele me percebe encarando logo de cara e dá um chute de brincadeira na minha direção."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:145
translate ptbr carltuesday_c2450986:

    # c "\"Pervert! First my moobs and now this.\""
    c "\"Pervertido! Primeiro meus peitinhos de homem e agora isso.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:146
translate ptbr carltuesday_4f192b3f:

    # "I jump back and he tries to follow me with a bigger swing of his legs and that's when the branch snaps loudly."
    "Eu pulo pra trás e ele tenta me acompanhar com um balanço maior das pernas e é aí que o galho quebra com um estalo alto."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:147
translate ptbr carltuesday_a8bc60bc:

    # "Carl goes down once again, landing squarely on his back."
    "O Carl vai pro chão mais uma vez, caindo em cheio de costas."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:153
translate ptbr carltuesday_a9592f1b:

    # c "\"Ooomph!\""
    c "\"Uuumpf!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:155
translate ptbr carltuesday_1d15ec9f:

    # "I cover my face instinctively, but I still hear the hollow thud, followed by the whoosh of breath going out of his lungs."
    "Eu cubro meu rosto instintivamente, mas ainda ouço o baque oco, seguido pelo som do ar saindo dos pulmões dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:156
translate ptbr carltuesday_839f80c0:

    # "Slowly I lower my paws and find the chubby ram rolling back and forth on the ground, eyes wide as his mouth hangs open."
    "Lentamente, abaixo as patas e encontro o carneiro gordinho rolando de um lado pro outro no chão, com os olhos arregalados e a boca aberta."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:157
translate ptbr carltuesday_21b0e1da:

    # "A distant memory comes to mind of a time when we were both ten and Carl was showing me a trick with his new bike ramp."
    "Uma memória distante me vem à mente de uma vez quando a gente tinha dez anos e o Carl tava me mostrando uma manobra com a rampa nova de bicicleta dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:158
translate ptbr carltuesday_434afb55:

    # "The handle bars ended up in his gut when he landed and he spent the following minute rolling around on the ground just like this."
    "O guidão acabou indo parar na barriga dele quando ele aterrissou, e ele passou o minuto seguinte rolando pelo chão exatamente assim."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:159
translate ptbr carltuesday_e88fe98e:

    # "Good times."
    "Bons tempos."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:160
translate ptbr carltuesday_2119182b:

    # m "\"Shiiit.\""
    m "\"Puuuuta merda.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:161
translate ptbr carltuesday_316b218d:

    # "I suck in air through my teeth and kneel next to him again, patting him uselessly."
    "Eu puxo o ar por entre os dentes e me ajoelho do lado dele de novo, dando uns tapinhas inúteis nele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:162
translate ptbr carltuesday_f9b8b339:

    # "After a few seconds of hesitation I reach over and grab the front of the waistband of his shorts and pull up on it."
    "Depois de alguns segundos de hesitação, eu me estico e pego a frente do cós do short dele e puxo pra cima."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:163
translate ptbr carltuesday_f3223186:

    # "Even though he's completely deflated he looks at me with a bizarre expression and swats at my paw, giving a few breathless snorts as he tries to laugh."
    "Apesar de estar completamente sem fôlego, ele olha pra mim com uma expressão bizarra e dá um tapa na minha pata, soltando uns bufos sem fôlego enquanto tenta rir."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:164
translate ptbr carltuesday_c445c584:

    # m "\"Hey, it's supposed to help you breathe! I've seen the coaches do it at school...\""
    m "\"Ei, isso deveria te ajudar a respirar! Eu já vi os treinadores fazerem isso na escola...\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:165
translate ptbr carltuesday_d0a238e2:

    # "I'm realizing that Carl's waaay too heavy to arch up like that, so I give up and end up just petting his stomach, wishing I could help somehow."
    "Eu percebo que o Carl é muuuito pesado pra se curvar daquele jeito, então eu desisto e acabo só fazendo carinho na barriga dele, querendo poder ajudar de alguma forma."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:166
translate ptbr carltuesday_347a7613:

    # m "\"Just...just stretch out.\""
    m "\"Só... só se estica.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:167
translate ptbr carltuesday_5b6e176a:

    # "His breath is already coming back, but he follows my instruction anyway and we sit there for a while, the silence punctuated by his heavy breathing."
    "A respiração dele já tá voltando, mas ele segue minha instrução assim mesmo e a gente fica sentado lá por um tempo, o silêncio pontuado pela respiração pesada dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:168
translate ptbr carltuesday_68e03918:

    # "I start laughing."
    "Eu começo a rir."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:169
translate ptbr carltuesday_7aeb170b:

    # m "\"Jesus Christ, Carl. Can you go one day without hurting yourself?\""
    m "\"Jesus Cristo, Carl. Você consegue passar um dia sem se machucar?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:170
translate ptbr carltuesday_54117ac2:

    # "He chuckles, too, his belly shaking under my paw."
    "Ele dá uma risadinha também, a barriga dele tremendo sob a minha pata."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:171
translate ptbr carltuesday_56050c23:

    # c "\"Now you know why I don't go outside. Ugh.\""
    c "\"Agora você sabe por que eu não saio de casa. Ugh.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:172
translate ptbr carltuesday_af629145:

    # "He slumps back for a while, taking in deep breaths before lifting his head again."
    "Ele fica deitado por um tempo, respirando fundo antes de levantar a cabeça de novo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:173
translate ptbr carltuesday_e693da0d:

    # "He looks down his chest at my paw and grins."
    "Ele olha pro próprio peito na direção da minha pata e dá um sorriso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:174
translate ptbr carltuesday_96c0df0f:

    # c "\"Seems like you can't keep your paws off me, though.\""
    c "\"Parece que você não consegue tirar as patas de mim, hein.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:175
translate ptbr carltuesday_1a1f10c4:

    # "I move my paw, letting him pull down his shirt as he grunts and sits up."
    "Eu tiro a minha pata, deixando ele abaixar a camisa enquanto solta um grunhido e se senta."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:176
translate ptbr carltuesday_296bac23:

    # m "\"How about I just let you suffocate next time.\""
    m "\"Que tal eu só deixar você sufocar da próxima vez.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:177
translate ptbr carltuesday_7e31b3f6:

    # c "\"I almost did, laughing while I couldn't breathe. I thought you were trying to grab my dick.\""
    c "\"Eu quase sufoquei, rindo enquanto não conseguia respirar. Eu achei que você tava tentando pegar no meu pau.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:178
translate ptbr carltuesday_6ba0110c:

    # "I put my paws on my hips."
    "Eu boto as patas na cintura."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:179
translate ptbr carltuesday_072713d0:

    # m "\"Is it because I'm gay?\""
    m "\"Isso é porque eu sou gay?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:180
translate ptbr carltuesday_796e2d68:

    # c "\"That might just be it.\""
    c "\"Pode ser que seja isso mesmo.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:181
translate ptbr carltuesday_019c146b:

    # "Carl grabs the branch that had broken off the tree and quirks up the corner of his mouth."
    "O Carl pega o galho que quebrou da árvore e torce o canto da boca."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:182
translate ptbr carltuesday_4c7ceb93:

    # c "\"Ugh, dad's not gonna be happy about that.\""
    c "\"Ugh, meu pai não vai ficar feliz com isso.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:183
translate ptbr carltuesday_4da10ac4:

    # m "\"Who cares? It's just a branch.\""
    m "\"Quem se importa? É só um galho.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:184
translate ptbr carltuesday_5c676d45:

    # c "\"You know my dad.\""
    c "\"Você conhece o meu pai.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:185
translate ptbr carltuesday_e62fc08b:

    # "He gets up and tosses the branch over the fence into the desert, then turns back to me."
    "Ele se levanta e joga o galho por cima da cerca pro deserto, depois se vira pra mim."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:186
translate ptbr carltuesday_f1c312e8:

    # c "\"So now that it feels like Lucha fucking Lobo just gave me the {i}Quebradora Con Giro{/i}, I think I'm done for the day.\""
    c "\"Então, agora que eu tô me sentindo como se a porra do Lucha Lobo tivesse me dado um {i}Quebradora Con Giro{/i}, acho que deu pra mim por hoje.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:187
translate ptbr carltuesday_586a42ba:

    # c "\"Wanna work on your project, now?\""
    c "\"Quer trabalhar no seu projeto agora?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:188
translate ptbr carltuesday_86b87d8a:

    # "I'd honestly rather just hang out out here with Carl, but the sun's enough to put a damper on that."
    "Eu honestamente preferiria só ficar de boa aqui fora com o Carl, mas o sol é o suficiente pra estragar isso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:194
translate ptbr carltuesday_6e8eb718:

    # "Carl's house is like a labyrinth."
    "A casa do Carl é tipo um labirinto."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:195
translate ptbr carltuesday_2ec4b04e:

    # "I think he once told me that it has over thirty rooms, which is fucking insane."
    "Acho que ele me disse uma vez que tem mais de trinta cômodos, o que é loucura pra caralho."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:196
translate ptbr carltuesday_a72b57c4:

    # "The living room is about five times larger than the one in my parent's house and it's hard to miss what looks like a 100 inch flat screen against the wall."
    "A sala de estar é umas cinco vezes maior que a da casa dos meus pais e é difícil não notar o que parece ser uma tela plana de 100 polegadas na parede."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:197
translate ptbr carltuesday_0a6f712d:

    # "According to Carl, the first mansion was even bigger, though."
    "Segundo o Carl, a primeira mansão era ainda maior, inclusive."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:198
translate ptbr carltuesday_e43bf1d9:

    # "After getting a drink he leads me straight downstairs into the basement."
    "Depois de pegar uma bebida, ele me leva direto pro porão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:199
translate ptbr carltuesday_c1c44d95:

    # "Down the hallway, we pass a small home theater, what looks like an entertainment room with a bar, and then a small gym."
    "No final do corredor, passamos por um pequeno home theater, o que parece ser uma sala de jogos com um bar, e depois uma pequena academia."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:200
translate ptbr carltuesday_031ef10e:

    # "The quick glance I get shows at least ten fitness contraptions."
    "A olhada rápida que eu dou me mostra pelo menos uns dez aparelhos de ginástica."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:201
translate ptbr carltuesday_8d927c28:

    # "After that, things get a little more dingey, and I can see how portions of the foundation could be decades old."
    "Depois disso, as coisas ficam um pouco mais sombrias, e eu consigo ver como partes da fundação poderiam ter décadas de idade."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:203
translate ptbr carltuesday_cb8ac66f:

    # "Finally, at the end of the hall, Carl opens a door and I can see from the ceiling that it's right under the stairs we came down on."
    "Finalmente, no fim do corredor, o Carl abre uma porta e eu consigo ver pelo teto que fica bem embaixo das escadas por onde a gente desceu."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:204
translate ptbr carltuesday_0f8cd845:

    # "Carl waves his paw around and finally grasps something before pulling down."
    "O Carl balança a pata por lá e finalmente agarra alguma coisa antes de puxar."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:205
translate ptbr carltuesday_c2a4d6d4:

    # "An old light bulb comes on and I see there's a little door with a small latch on it."
    "Uma lâmpada velha acende e eu vejo que tem uma portinha com um trinco nela."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:207
translate ptbr carltuesday_db32f2a3:

    # "He opens it and I'm greeted with a musty smell as Carl slides through the opening."
    "Ele a abre e sou recebido por um cheiro de mofo enquanto o Carl desliza pela abertura."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:210
translate ptbr carltuesday_556c9ae2:

    # "I follow tentatively, making sure I'm not walking into any cobwebs."
    "Eu sigo ele meio hesitante, me certificando de que não tô andando em nenhuma teia de aranha."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:211
translate ptbr carltuesday_3a232acd:

    # m "\"Are there a lot of spiders down here?\""
    m "\"Tem muita aranha aqui embaixo?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:212
translate ptbr carltuesday_635a85cd:

    # c "\"I don't think so. We sprayed a few weeks ago.\""
    c "\"Acho que não. A gente dedetizou há algumas semanas.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:213
translate ptbr carltuesday_8ec09162:

    # "It's extremely dark and I hear Carl grunting next to me."
    "Tá extremamente escuro e eu ouço o Carl grunhindo do meu lado."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:214
translate ptbr carltuesday_c814e9d9:

    # c "\"Ugh, there's a floodlight here somewhere...Ah! Here it is.\""
    c "\"Ugh, tem um refletor por aqui em algum lugar... Ah! Achei.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:218
translate ptbr carltuesday_01dd189a:

    # "Like everything in this house, it's big for a crawl space."
    "Como tudo nessa casa, é bem grande pra um porão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:219
translate ptbr carltuesday_c177990a:

    # "Pillars sprout from the ground in two rows that stretch back almost into darkness."
    "Pilares brotam do chão em duas fileiras que se estendem lá pro fundo, quase no escuro."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:220
translate ptbr carltuesday_c622f874:

    # "The ground is covered in a tarp and I see dozens of plastic bins lining the walls."
    "O chão tá coberto por uma lona e eu vejo dezenas de caixas de plástico alinhadas nas paredes."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:221
translate ptbr carltuesday_cdf59132:

    # m "\"This is a lot of shit.\""
    m "\"Isso é muita merda.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:222
translate ptbr carltuesday_1545fd9e:

    # c "\"Yup, it's a few generations worth of shit.\""
    c "\"É, algumas gerações de merda.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:223
translate ptbr carltuesday_66a91c65:

    # "I walk over the tarp to look into one of the bins, but all I can see is clumps of cloth and towel through the cloudy plastic."
    "Eu ando por cima da lona pra dar uma olhada em uma das caixas, mas tudo que eu consigo ver são amontoados de pano e toalhas pelo plástico turvo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:224
translate ptbr carltuesday_d28f27d2:

    # "Carl walks past me straight towards the back of the crawl space, his big hooves clopping along loudly."
    "O Carl passa por mim direto pro fundo do porão, os cascos grandes dele fazendo um som de trote alto."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:225
translate ptbr carltuesday_73398d39:

    # c "\"I actually helped them sort through all this stuff last year, so I think I know where it is.\""
    c "\"Eu na verdade ajudei a separar toda essa tralha ano passado, então acho que sei onde tá.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:226
translate ptbr carltuesday_9789a6dd:

    # "I follow him, but it's hard to see in the darkness."
    "Eu sigo ele, mas tá difícil de ver na escuridão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:227
translate ptbr carltuesday_dfe2b614:

    # m "\"Should we get a flashlight?\""
    m "\"A gente deveria pegar uma lanterna?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:228
translate ptbr carltuesday_de3df854:

    # c "\"Naw, it's only in two tubs, I think. We'll just pull 'em to the front.\""
    c "\"Nah, acho que tão só em duas caixas. A gente só puxa elas pra frente.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:229
translate ptbr carltuesday_93d326d5:

    # "I stand off to the side as I watch him push bins around, looking at the labels on top."
    "Eu fico de lado observando ele empurrar umas caixas, olhando as etiquetas em cima delas."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:230
translate ptbr carltuesday_8f27db3f:

    # "I look over at one of them and see \"home movies\" written on it and it's filled with cassettes."
    "Eu olho pra uma delas e vejo \"vídeos caseiros\" escrito, e ela tá cheia de fitas."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:232
translate ptbr carltuesday_066ae07c:

    # c "\"Ugh, don't remind me.\""
    c "\"Ugh, nem me lembre.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:233
translate ptbr carltuesday_6685ad4a:

    # "I look up and see that Carl's noticed me staring at the bin."
    "Eu levanto a cabeça e vejo que o Carl percebeu eu encarando a caixa."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:234
translate ptbr carltuesday_df8ec4bc:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"Que foi?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:235
translate ptbr carltuesday_e718b259:

    # "Carl grunts as he lifts up a bin and drops it pretty carelessly to the floor. I'm pretty sure I hear something break."
    "O Carl grunhe enquanto levanta uma caixa e a larga de forma bem descuidada no chão. Tenho quase certeza que ouvi algo quebrar."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:236
translate ptbr carltuesday_72cb327a:

    # c "\"Mom had me help her convert all that to digital. Took all fuckin' year.\""
    c "\"Minha mãe me fez ajudar ela a converter tudo isso pro digital. Levou o ano da porra todo.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:237
translate ptbr carltuesday_93bd3770:

    # m "\"Wow...\""
    m "\"Uau...\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:238
translate ptbr carltuesday_1cc32da8:

    # c "\"Yeah, it's in the cloud now. You're actually in a lot of those videos.\""
    c "\"É, tá na nuvem agora. Você tá em um monte desses vídeos, aliás.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:239
translate ptbr carltuesday_19d50e7e:

    # m "\"Huh, really?\""
    m "\"Hã, sério?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:240
translate ptbr carltuesday_4796ca8e:

    # c "\"Yeah, birthday parties and shit.\""
    c "\"É, festas de aniversário e essas coisas.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:241
translate ptbr carltuesday_61bdf546:

    # "Of course I would be."
    "É claro que eu estaria."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:242
translate ptbr carltuesday_2bb3007a:

    # "Carl's dad practically had a video camera glued to his eye back in the day."
    "O pai do Carl praticamente tinha uma câmera de vídeo colada no olho na nossa época."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:243
translate ptbr carltuesday_03efad63:

    # "I used to hang out with Carl almost as much as I did Leo once we started going out."
    "Eu costumava ficar com o Carl quase tanto quanto com o Leo depois que a gente começou a sair."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:244
translate ptbr carltuesday_1af7b8a3:

    # "I even went on their family vacation a few times."
    "Eu até fui nas férias da família deles algumas vezes."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:245
translate ptbr carltuesday_b9025af6:

    # "But then me going out with Leo changed things. Looking back, I think Carl was kind of unhappy with that."
    "Mas aí eu sair com o Leo mudou as coisas. Olhando pra trás, acho que o Carl não ficou muito feliz com isso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:246
translate ptbr carltuesday_b5c1601a:

    # c "\"We can watch a few once we're done here, if you want.\""
    c "\"A gente pode ver alguns quando terminar aqui, se você quiser.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:247
translate ptbr carltuesday_6894cf49:

    # m "\"Uh, sure.\""
    m "\"Hã, claro.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:248
translate ptbr carltuesday_c337db64:

    # "That sounds like an old person thing to do, but I am curious."
    "Isso soa como coisa de velho, mas eu tô curioso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:249
translate ptbr carltuesday_63b285ed:

    # c "\"Found it!\""
    c "\"Achei!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:250
translate ptbr carltuesday_7ea88af4:

    # "Carl slides out two plastic bins and I see \"History\" written on the top."
    "O Carl puxa duas caixas de plástico e eu vejo \"História\" escrito em cima."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:251
translate ptbr carltuesday_56be076b:

    # c "\"Help me carry one.\""
    c "\"Me ajuda a carregar uma.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:252
translate ptbr carltuesday_fb8e53af:

    # "Carl lifts up the top one and starts waddling back to the front."
    "O Carl levanta a de cima e começa a voltar gingando pra frente."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:254
translate ptbr carltuesday_98064f2f:

    # "I bend over and lift the second and I'm surprised at how fucking heavy it is."
    "Eu me curvo pra levantar a segunda e me surpreendo com o quão pesada pra caralho ela é."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:255
translate ptbr carltuesday_59c6d691:

    # "I'm worried I'm not even gonna get it off the ground for a few seconds, but I manage after a while."
    "Fico preocupado que nem vou conseguir tirar ela do chão por uns segundos, mas eu dou conta depois de um tempo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:256
translate ptbr carltuesday_b5feb312:

    # "If Carl's bin is as heavy as mine then he's a fucking beast at being able to lift and carry it like that."
    "Se a caixa do Carl for tão pesada quanto a minha, então ele é um monstro pra conseguir levantar e carregar ela daquele jeito."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:257
translate ptbr carltuesday_65323f67:

    # "I stagger after him, almost certain that I'm gonna go head first into the wall."
    "Eu cambaleio atrás dele, quase certo de que vou dar de cara na parede."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:258
translate ptbr carltuesday_024d59f4:

    # "Once we make it back near the stairs, I bend over to set down my bin and that's when I see a massive spider sitting on the lid."
    "Quando chegamos de volta perto da escada, me curvo pra colocar a minha caixa no chão, e é aí que vejo uma aranha gigantesca sentada na tampa."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:259
translate ptbr carltuesday_2ae9f526:

    # "It takes about half a second for me to recognize the black shape and spindly legs."
    "Levo cerca de meio segundo pra reconhecer a forma preta e as pernas compridas."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:260
translate ptbr carltuesday_a5a9eec6:

    # m "\"Oh FUCK!\""
    m "\"Ai CARALHO!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:262
translate ptbr carltuesday_e109f5b3:

    # "I scream and drop the bin and before I know it I'm halfway back from where we came, panting and shivering."
    "Eu dou um grito e solto a caixa e antes que eu perceba, eu já tô na metade do caminho de volta, ofegando e tremendo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:264
translate ptbr carltuesday_8e012168:

    # c "\"Holy shit, what happened?\""
    c "\"Puta merda, o que foi?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:265
translate ptbr carltuesday_33f3deb7:

    # "I tremble and try to steady my voice."
    "Eu tremo e tento estabilizar a voz."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:266
translate ptbr carltuesday_47190685:

    # m "\"A fucking spider!\""
    m "\"Uma aranha do caralho!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:268
translate ptbr carltuesday_c2355900:

    # c "\"What? You're really still scared of those? Man, for a second I thought my sister came home and then got murdered.\""
    c "\"O quê? Você ainda tem medo dessas coisas? Cara, por um segundo eu achei que minha irmã tinha chegado em casa e sido assassinada.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:269
translate ptbr carltuesday_ec3a3852:

    # m "\"You told me there weren't any!\""
    m "\"Você me disse que não tinha nenhuma!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:270
translate ptbr carltuesday_624e3b70:

    # c "\"I didn't say that. I just said we sprayed.\""
    c "\"Eu não disse isso. Eu só disse que a gente dedetizou.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:271
translate ptbr carltuesday_564087c0:

    # m "\"Just get rid of it!\""
    m "\"Só se livra dela!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:272
translate ptbr carltuesday_561f8fe6:

    # "At this point I've shuffled a little closer back to the light and I can see Carl grinning as be bends over to look at the lid of the bin."
    "A esse ponto, eu já tinha me arrastado um pouco mais pra perto da luz e consigo ver o Carl sorrindo enquanto se inclina pra olhar a tampa da caixa."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:273
translate ptbr carltuesday_67931c1e:

    # c "\"Whoa! It's got babies on its back!\""
    c "\"Eita! Ela tem filhotes nas costas!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:274
translate ptbr carltuesday_57f4fee1:

    # "My body gives a violent, involuntary spasm and I shake my paws like a fucking girl."
    "Meu corpo dá um espasmo violento e involuntário e eu sacudo as patas que nem uma menininha da porra."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:275
translate ptbr carltuesday_d2a87ea1:

    # m "\"Stop it!\""
    m "\"Para!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:276
translate ptbr carltuesday_b4eb97dc:

    # "He glances up at me with that stupid smile still on his face."
    "Ele olha pra mim com aquele sorriso estúpido ainda no rosto."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:277
translate ptbr carltuesday_a9032a12:

    # c "\"Wow, that was gay. But seriously, it's got a bunch of tiny babies on its back. I think it's a wolf spider?\""
    c "\"Uau, isso foi meio gay. Mas falando sério, ela tem um monte de bebezinhos nas costas. Acho que é uma aranha-lobo?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:278
translate ptbr carltuesday_34c5ba85:

    # "I swear I'm gonna pass the hell out if he doesn't stop talking."
    "Eu juro que vou desmaiar pra caralho se ele não parar de falar."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:279
translate ptbr carltuesday_fcca2bdc:

    # "I cover my face."
    "Eu cubro meu rosto."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:280
translate ptbr carltuesday_660bd003:

    # m "\"{i}Pleeeeaase{/i}.\""
    m "\"{i}Por favooooor{/i}.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:281
translate ptbr carltuesday_d823ea2e:

    # c "\"Alright, alright. I didn't know you were that scared of 'em. You should probably get that checked out.\""
    c "\"Tá bom, tá bom. Eu não sabia que você tinha tanto medo delas. Você provavelmente devia dar uma olhada nisso.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:282
translate ptbr carltuesday_efc3d8f0:

    # "Considering that I'd almost crashed my car into the garage of my parent's house when a spider crawled out of the AC, he was probably right."
    "Considerando que eu quase bati meu carro na garagem da casa dos meus pais quando uma aranha saiu do ar-condicionado, ele provavelmente tava certo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:283
translate ptbr carltuesday_44ba552d:

    # m "\"Just kill it.\""
    m "\"Só mata ela.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:284
translate ptbr carltuesday_f2159417:

    # c "\"Why would I do that?\""
    c "\"Por que eu faria isso?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:285
translate ptbr carltuesday_7a8d11df:

    # "I watch as he tilts the bin sideways."
    "Eu o observo inclinar a caixa de lado."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:286
translate ptbr carltuesday_fe73fe22:

    # c "\"It's not gonna hurt anyone.\""
    c "\"Ela não vai machucar ninguém.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:287
translate ptbr carltuesday_954bcaf5:

    # "I want to tell him that those babies are only going to grow into a hundred more giant wolf spiders."
    "Eu quero dizer a ele que aqueles bebês só vão crescer e virar mais umas cem aranhas-lobo gigantes."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:288
translate ptbr carltuesday_9429da5b:

    # "But I realize I'll just come off as a bloodthirsty asshole, so I bite my lip as I watch the black spot skitter off into the darkness."
    "Mas eu percebo que vou parecer um cuzão sedento por sangue, então eu mordo o lábio enquanto assisto a mancha preta sumir na escuridão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:289
translate ptbr carltuesday_da7a1a63:

    # "I walk back towards Carl, hugging my shoulders as I try to control the chills running through me."
    "Eu ando de volta pro Carl, me abraçando enquanto tento controlar os arrepios que correm pelo meu corpo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:290
translate ptbr carltuesday_29720d87:

    # "Now I'm gonna be paranoid the whole time that it's gonna come back out to get me."
    "Agora eu vou ficar paranoico o tempo todo achando que ela vai voltar pra me pegar."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:291
translate ptbr carltuesday_f92ccaa8:

    # "Carl rubs my back when I stand next to him."
    "O Carl esfrega as minhas costas quando eu paro do lado dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:292
translate ptbr carltuesday_48b04c0b:

    # c "\"You know, they actually clean up a lot of other bugs that get into the house.\""
    c "\"Sabe, na verdade elas limpam um monte de outros insetos que entram na casa.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:293
translate ptbr carltuesday_da389117:

    # m "\"Yeeah, well, I'd rather be covered in ants than spiders.\""
    m "\"Éee, bom, eu prefiro ficar coberto de formigas do que de aranhas.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:294
translate ptbr carltuesday_d40ca666:

    # "It's clear he's trying not to laugh at me as he starts popping the lid off his bin."
    "Fica claro que ele tá tentando não rir de mim enquanto começa a tirar a tampa da caixa dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:295
translate ptbr carltuesday_7e0d744a:

    # "On the top are a few framed pictures and under those are a few more cardboard boxes."
    "Por cima tem alguns quadros de fotos e por baixo tem mais algumas caixas de papelão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:296
translate ptbr carltuesday_d21328bd:

    # "I release the latches on the other bin, keeping my eye out for any black spots that might jump out at me."
    "Eu solto as travas da outra caixa, mantendo o olho aberto pra qualquer mancha preta que possa pular em mim."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:297
translate ptbr carltuesday_88b8b699:

    # "This one is filled with bundles wrapped in cloth or paper."
    "Essa tá cheia de pacotes embrulhados em tecido ou papel."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:298
translate ptbr carltuesday_18d0cb16:

    # "Carl drags his bin to the steps so that he can sit on them, and I follow suit."
    "O Carl arrasta a caixa dele pros degraus pra poder sentar neles, e eu faço o mesmo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:299
translate ptbr carltuesday_9744fc4c:

    # c "\"So how do you think you'll use this stuff?\""
    c "\"Então, como você acha que vai usar essa parada toda?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:300
translate ptbr carltuesday_511a7243_1:

    # m "\"Um...\""
    m "\"Hum...\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:301
translate ptbr carltuesday_e5060518:

    # "I unwrap a smaller bundle and look at the gold pocket watch underneath."
    "Eu desembrulho um pacote menor e olho pro relógio de bolso dourado embaixo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:302
translate ptbr carltuesday_79841a60:

    # m "\"Wow. Uh, well, not totally sure. Depends on what we find. Might film a few things.\""
    m "\"Uau. Hã, bem, não tenho certeza absoluta. Depende do que a gente achar. Talvez filmar algumas coisas.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:305
translate ptbr carltuesday_db0d4ee0:

    # "There's a paper tag attached to the chain with \"Robert Hendricks\" written on it."
    "Tem uma etiqueta de papel presa na corrente com \"Robert Hendricks\" escrito."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:306
translate ptbr carltuesday_f1c73930:

    # m "\"Who's this?\""
    m "\"Quem é esse?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:307
translate ptbr carltuesday_88009e95:

    # "Carl gives it a glance."
    "O Carl dá uma olhada rápida."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:308
translate ptbr carltuesday_fa2b9884:

    # c "\"No idea. Probably a great uncle, or something.\""
    c "\"Não faço ideia. Provavelmente um tio-avô, ou coisa assim.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:309
translate ptbr carltuesday_dbe0c89c:

    # "I wrap the pocket watch and reach back into the bin to pull out the next item."
    "Eu embrulho o relógio de bolso e alcanço a caixa de novo pra tirar o próximo item."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:310
translate ptbr carltuesday_4a8290d9:

    # "There's something really cool about old stuff. My mind wanders to who might have made it, who bought it, and how much shit it must have seen."
    "Tem alguma coisa muito legal em coisas antigas. Minha mente viaja pensando em quem pode ter feito, quem comprou e o tanto de merda que já deve ter visto."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:311
translate ptbr carltuesday_e344d773:

    # "History was my first choice to major in, but dad put a stop to that pretty quick..."
    "História era minha primeira opção de curso na faculdade, mas meu pai cortou isso rapidinho..."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:312
translate ptbr carltuesday_49138fee:

    # "I pull out various other things: dolls, a pipe, coins, and another pocket watch."
    "Eu tiro várias outras coisas: bonecas, um cachimbo, moedas e outro relógio de bolso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:313
translate ptbr carltuesday_a7464f14:

    # m "\"I feel like this is worth a lot of money. Why don't they sell it?\""
    m "\"Eu sinto que isso vale muito dinheiro. Por que eles não vendem?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:314
translate ptbr carltuesday_36972b2e:

    # c "\"Probably, but it's family stuff, and I still think they wanna do the museum.\""
    c "\"Provavelmente, mas é coisa de família, e eu ainda acho que eles querem fazer o museu.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:315
translate ptbr carltuesday_59d216a3:

    # "He gives an awkward cough."
    "Ele dá uma tossida meio sem jeito."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:316
translate ptbr carltuesday_e6bc8a31:

    # c "\"'Sides, we already got plenty of money.\""
    c "\"Além disso, a gente já tem dinheiro de sobra.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:317
translate ptbr carltuesday_a7d6c4da:

    # "He's got the binder open, looking at black and white photos behind the plastic."
    "Ele tá com o fichário aberto, olhando umas fotos em preto e branco por trás do plástico."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:318
translate ptbr carltuesday_d210f625:

    # c "\"Hey, this is him, right?\""
    c "\"Ei, é ele, né?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:319
translate ptbr carltuesday_d36fb957:

    # "He points at a picture of a very dignified looking ram, thumbs in his vest, wearing one of those big top hats. A fox stands next to him in a similar pose."
    "Ele aponta pra foto de um carneiro com cara de muito digno, polegares no colete, usando um daqueles chapéus altos e grandes. Uma raposa tá do lado dele numa pose parecida."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:320
translate ptbr carltuesday_9ec562ca:

    # "I can see a piece of yellowed paper set behind the photo and tug it out."
    "Eu consigo ver um pedaço de papel amarelado atrás da foto e puxo ele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:321
translate ptbr carltuesday_0e0a83c5:

    # m "\"James Hendricks. Yep, definitely him. And John Begay...huh.\""
    m "\"James Hendricks. É, com certeza é ele. E John Begay... hã.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:322
translate ptbr carltuesday_022c47d9:

    # "That's Jenna's last name."
    "Esse é o sobrenome da Jenna."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:326
translate ptbr carltuesday_b21e9599:

    # "Carl's phone starts buzzing and he grunts as he leans back to pull it out of his pocket."
    "O celular do Carl começa a vibrar e ele solta um grunhido enquanto se inclina pra trás pra tirar do bolso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:327
translate ptbr carltuesday_79a0bf47:

    # c "\"Hey mom...helping Chase with his project.\""
    c "\"Oi mãe... tô ajudando o Chase no projeto dele.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:328
translate ptbr carltuesday_d035e166:

    # c "\"No, I—of course not.\""
    c "\"Não, eu... claro que não.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:329
translate ptbr carltuesday_8accb8a3:

    # "I look over at him, but he gets up and clops back up the steps."
    "Eu olho pra ele, mas ele se levanta e sobe os degraus fazendo barulho de casco."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:331
translate ptbr carltuesday_5c27eae9:

    # "Looking back down at the picture I wonder if it's just coincidence, but I don't think so."
    "Olhando de volta pra foto, me pergunto se é só coincidência, mas acho que não."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:332
translate ptbr carltuesday_f791ba2c:

    # "Jenna's family has been in Echo since the beginning, too, so this guy definitely has to be a relative of some kind."
    "A família da Jenna tá em Echo desde o começo, também, então esse cara com certeza tem que ser algum tipo de parente."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:334
translate ptbr carltuesday_95b80f90:

    # "I take a picture of the photograph with my phone. I'll show it to Jenna later and ask if she knows anything about it."
    "Eu tiro uma foto da fotografia com o meu celular. Vou mostrar pra Jenna depois e perguntar se ela sabe alguma coisa sobre isso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:335
translate ptbr carltuesday_3349ac5a:

    # c "\"—to do that without a car!?\""
    c "\"—fazer isso sem um carro!?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:336
translate ptbr carltuesday_793004d1:

    # "Carl raises his voice so I look back up the steps, wondering if I should close the door. Hearing him angry like that didn't feel right."
    "O Carl aumenta o tom de voz e eu olho de volta pros degraus, me perguntando se eu deveria fechar a porta. Ouvir ele bravo daquele jeito não pareceu certo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:337
translate ptbr carltuesday_bb25b8a1:

    # "His parents were always hard on him, but I guess they had their reasons."
    "Os pais dele sempre pegavam pesado com ele, mas eu acho que eles tinham os motivos deles."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:338
translate ptbr carltuesday_c63d9106:

    # "I spend the next twenty minutes shuffling through the bins, trying to be careful not to break anything."
    "Eu passo os próximos vinte minutos mexendo nas caixas, tentando ter cuidado pra não quebrar nada."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:339
translate ptbr carltuesday_05ce19b8:

    # "I decide I have enough and put the lids back on the bins, lining the stuff I picked out along one of the steps since I don't have anywhere else to put them."
    "Eu decido que já deu e coloco as tampas de volta nas caixas, alinhando as coisas que eu peguei num dos degraus, já que não tenho outro lugar pra botar elas."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:341
translate ptbr carltuesday_deaf3331:

    # "By the time I head back up into the actual basement, Carl's gone."
    "Quando eu volto pro porão de verdade, o Carl sumiu."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:345
translate ptbr carltuesday_2f0b38aa:

    # "As I approach Carl's room I smell it before I even open the door."
    "Quando me aproximo do quarto do Carl, eu sinto o cheiro antes mesmo de abrir a porta."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:346
translate ptbr carltuesday_27625fae:

    # "He's reclined on his bed, an arm thrown over his face, the big window above him open."
    "Ele tá reclinado na cama, com um braço jogado sobre o rosto, e a janela grande em cima dele tá aberta."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:347
translate ptbr carltuesday_2fd2d90c:

    # "Clothes are scattered all over the floor, along with a few empty water bottles and bowls."
    "Roupas tão espalhadas pelo chão, junto com algumas garrafas de água vazias e tigelas."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:348
translate ptbr carltuesday_742f2934:

    # "Every inch of the walls are covered in posters like I remember, along with a few on the ceiling."
    "Cada centímetro das paredes tá coberto de pôsteres como eu me lembro, além de alguns no teto."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:349
translate ptbr carltuesday_29f1382d:

    # "Bookcases line the opposite wall, filled to the brim with comics and toys."
    "Estantes de livros preenchem a parede oposta, lotadas até a boca de quadrinhos e brinquedos."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:350
translate ptbr carltuesday_c445ac4e:

    # "He raises up his arm as I walk in and smiles."
    "Ele levanta o braço quando eu entro e dá um sorriso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:352
translate ptbr carltuesday_fee83def:

    # c "\"Sorry about the mess, dude. It's hard to keep everything clean when my parents aren't here to yell at me about it.\""
    c "\"Desculpa a bagunça, cara. É difícil manter tudo limpo quando os meus pais não tão aqui pra gritar comigo por causa disso.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:353
translate ptbr carltuesday_162c3dab:

    # "The lazy, crackly sound in his voice has returned full force. His eyes are distant."
    "Aquele som arrastado e lento na voz dele voltou com força total. O olhar dele tá distante."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:354
translate ptbr carltuesday_377a10ea:

    # m "\"It's okay...Are you okay?\""
    m "\"Tudo bem... Você tá bem?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:355
translate ptbr carltuesday_74e6ffc8:

    # "He grins toothily."
    "Ele dá um sorriso mostrando os dentes."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:356
translate ptbr carltuesday_21bf6cd9:

    # c "\"Dude, I'm MORE than okay.\""
    c "\"Cara, eu tô MAIS que bem.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:357
translate ptbr carltuesday_6246d3a8:

    # "Since there's no where else to sit I end up sitting down on the foot of his bed."
    "Já que não tem mais lugar nenhum pra sentar, eu acabo sentando no pé da cama dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:358
translate ptbr carltuesday_c1c6d332:

    # m "\"Do they...do they let you smoke in here?\""
    m "\"Eles... eles deixam você fumar aqui dentro?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:359
translate ptbr carltuesday_05156db3:

    # "The smell in his room is layered and old, like the walls had been blanketed in the smell several times before."
    "O cheiro no quarto dele tem várias camadas e é velho, como se as paredes já tivessem sido impregnadas por esse cheiro muitas vezes."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:360
translate ptbr carltuesday_3ccf2cb3:

    # c "\"Eeeyup. They gave up trying to stop me.\""
    c "\"Iiih, sim. Eles desistiram de tentar me parar.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:361
translate ptbr carltuesday_3da65621:

    # c "\"Better to be in the house rather than getting caught by some cop outside. They just made me promise that I wouldn't ever try something harder.\""
    c "\"É melhor tá dentro de casa do que ser pego por um policial lá fora. Eles só me fizeram prometer que eu nunca ia tentar algo mais pesado.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:362
translate ptbr carltuesday_a5a9270c:

    # c "\"Heh, good thing they don't know I've already tried dick.\""
    c "\"Heh, ainda bem que eles não sabem que eu já provei pau.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:363
translate ptbr carltuesday_ed0c7b4d:

    # "He puts a lot of emphasis on the 'K' as the bad joke seems to just dribble out his muzzle."
    "Ele coloca muita ênfase no 'pau' enquanto a piada ruim parece só escorrer pelo focinho dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:364
translate ptbr carltuesday_61ca8fa6:

    # m "\"Hmm.\""
    m "\"Hmm.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:365
translate ptbr carltuesday_a7cdcb2c:

    # "I lean back on the bed and that's when I notice his flat screen (just a 48 inch) is on, a list of video files displayed on it."
    "Eu me recosto na cama e é aí que noto que a TV de tela plana dele (só uma de 48 polegadas) tá ligada, com uma lista de arquivos de vídeo aparecendo nela."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:366
translate ptbr carltuesday_f63eda00:

    # m "\"Wat'cha watching?\""
    m "\"O que cê tá assistindo?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:367
translate ptbr carltuesday_e5b9abf8:

    # c "\"Hmm? Oh!\""
    c "\"Hmm? Ah!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:368
translate ptbr carltuesday_60104b2e:

    # "Carl grunts as he sits up and reaches for a game controller."
    "O Carl grunhe enquanto se senta e alcança um controle de videogame."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:369
translate ptbr carltuesday_4e1548b0:

    # c "\"Our old home movies. Was gonna show you some of 'em.\""
    c "\"Nossos vídeos caseiros antigos. Eu ia te mostrar alguns deles.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:370
translate ptbr carltuesday_871257e0:

    # c "\"How about...a birthday?\""
    c "\"Que tal... um aniversário?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:371
translate ptbr carltuesday_910f899d:

    # m "\"Sure.\""
    m "\"Claro.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:372
translate ptbr carltuesday_f82e95ee:

    # "He scrolls down the list, then stops when \"Carl's 8th\" is highlighted and presses play."
    "Ele rola a lista pra baixo, aí para quando \"8º do Carl\" tá destacado e aperta play."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:375
translate ptbr carltuesday_68c98673:

    # "The backyard I was in an hour earlier pops up on the screen."
    "O quintal em que eu tava uma hora atrás aparece na tela."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:376
translate ptbr carltuesday_1e46a536:

    # "Now a long table sits in the middle of the lawn, along with a massive bounce house."
    "Agora uma mesa comprida tá no meio do gramado, junto com um pula-pula gigante."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:377
translate ptbr carltuesday_6095198c:

    # "And not just any bounce house, but a giant, two-story one you'd find at the state fair."
    "E não qualquer pula-pula, mas um gigante de dois andares que você encontraria num parque de diversões."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:378
translate ptbr carltuesday_a4ec6675:

    # "The video is timestamped Apr. 19 2002."
    "O vídeo tem a data de 19 de abril de 2002."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:379
translate ptbr carltuesday_8bfa9936:

    # m "\"Fuck, I remember this.\""
    m "\"Porra, eu lembro disso.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:380
translate ptbr carltuesday_0011af73:

    # "There are about twenty kids, mostly in the bounce house and most of whom I've forgotten."
    "Tem umas vinte crianças, a maioria no pula-pula e a maioria das quais eu já esqueci."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:381
translate ptbr carltuesday_c27231ce:

    # "Right now, though, the camera's zooming in on an eight year old Carl."
    "Agora mesmo, porém, a câmera tá dando um zoom num Carl de oito anos."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:382
translate ptbr carltuesday_6f9445fd:

    # "He's messing with a giant Nerf gun, the kind that no kid ever gets because they're so damn expensive."
    "Ele tá mexendo com uma arma de Nerf gigante, do tipo que criança nenhuma nunca ganha porque é cara pra caralho."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:383
translate ptbr carltuesday_03f64dce:

    # "And that's when eight year old me enters the picture, holding a much smaller Nerf gun."
    "E é aí que meu eu de oito anos entra em cena, segurando uma arma de Nerf bem menor."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:384
translate ptbr carltuesday_e299e0cc:

    # "His parents gave everyone a goodie bag that day. It had toys in it that I might not have been able to get on my own birthday."
    "Os pais dele deram uma sacolinha de lembrancinhas pra todo mundo naquele dia. Tinha brinquedos nela que talvez eu não tivesse conseguido ganhar nem no meu próprio aniversário."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:385
translate ptbr carltuesday_a98de411:

    # "My kid self puts the gun to Carl's head and pulls the trigger, the dart bouncing off one of his horns."
    "O meu eu criança aponta a arma pra cabeça do Carl e puxa o gatilho, e o dardo quica em um dos chifres dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:386
translate ptbr carltuesday_900ac78c:

    # "I specifically remember that moment. I had thought the suction end of the dart was going to stick, but of course it didn't."
    "Eu me lembro especificamente daquele momento. Eu tinha pensado que a ponta de sucção do dardo ia grudar, mas claro que não grudou."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:387
translate ptbr carltuesday_c961dee1:

    # "The audio is filled with a deep chuckle; Carl's dad behind the camera."
    "O áudio se enche de uma risada profunda; o pai do Carl atrás da câmera."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:388
translate ptbr carltuesday_32499e50:

    # c "\"You were a dick back then.\""
    c "\"Você era um babaca naquela época.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:389
translate ptbr carltuesday_1c479ddc:

    # m "\"What? I was eight!\""
    m "\"O quê? Eu tinha oito anos!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:390
translate ptbr carltuesday_5473fb7d:

    # c "\"Still, you blew out my candles.\""
    c "\"Ainda assim, você soprou as minhas velas.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:391
translate ptbr carltuesday_2964f832:

    # m "\"Oh yeah...\""
    m "\"Ah é...\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:392
translate ptbr carltuesday_0ac1c0ff:

    # "He got so mad about that."
    "Ele ficou tão puto com isso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:393
translate ptbr carltuesday_75ddbc39:

    # "I start to settle back and smile."
    "Eu começo a me recostar e dou um sorriso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:394
translate ptbr carltuesday_7e3ea86e:

    # "It's been a long time since I've watched a home movie and I've forgotten how nice it is to have this method of looking back."
    "Faz muito tempo desde que eu não assistia a um vídeo caseiro e eu tinha esquecido como é legal ter esse jeito de olhar pro passado."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:395
translate ptbr carltuesday_bc9ce241:

    # "Kind of like when I get stuck on scrolling through all the old images on my phone."
    "É meio como quando eu fico preso rodando por todas as fotos antigas no meu celular."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:396
translate ptbr carltuesday_b83ddd60:

    # "My younger self is trying to help Carl with the gun, lifting up the barrel and looking into the opening."
    "O meu eu mais novo tá tentando ajudar o Carl com a arma, levantando o cano e olhando pra dentro do buraco."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:397
translate ptbr carltuesday_a6b768ad:

    # "Jim" "\"Careful!\""
    "Jim" "\"Cuidado!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:398
translate ptbr carltuesday_2f0f0cac:

    # "Kid Chase pulls his head back with a jolt as Carl's dad yells, then mutters behind the camera."
    "O Chase criança puxa a cabeça pra trás com um solavanco quando o pai do Carl grita, e aí resmunga atrás da câmera."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:399
translate ptbr carltuesday_66d5c522:

    # "Jim" "\"Let's see how long it takes him to trick Carl into trading with him.\""
    "Jim" "\"Vamos ver quanto tempo leva pra ele enganar o Carl pra trocar com ele.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:400
translate ptbr carltuesday_69bed487:

    # "Carl's dad sounds exasperated, but good-natured."
    "O pai do Carl soa exasperado, mas de bom humor."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:401
translate ptbr carltuesday_54391933:

    # "It still makes me blush a bit, now knowing how aware Jim was of my taking advantage of his son."
    "Isso ainda me faz corar um pouco, agora sabendo o quão ciente o Jim tava de que eu me aproveitava do filho dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:402
translate ptbr carltuesday_6fd10ae4:

    # "Our struggles with the Nerf gun gets the attention of another kid, though."
    "A nossa dificuldade com a arma de Nerf atrai a atenção de outra criança, no entanto."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:403
translate ptbr carltuesday_0f1f27e9:

    # "My breath catches in my throat as Sydney bounces into frame."
    "A minha respiração trava na garganta quando o Sydney entra pulando no quadro."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:405
translate ptbr carltuesday_58df3d96:

    # "I can feel Carl tensing up next to me, too, and he starts to lean for the game controller."
    "Eu consigo sentir o Carl ficar tenso do meu lado também, e ele começa a se inclinar pro controle do videogame."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:406
translate ptbr carltuesday_22c26f14:

    # "Jim" "\"And here comes the Mormon boy.\""
    "Jim" "\"E lá vem o garoto mórmon.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:407
translate ptbr carltuesday_1e0687df:

    # "The disgust in Carl's dad's voice shocks me and I hear Carl whisper a curse next to me as he fumbles for the controller."
    "O nojo na voz do pai do Carl me choca e eu ouço o Carl sussurrar um xingamento do meu lado enquanto ele tenta pegar o controle."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:408
# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:408
translate ptbr carltuesday_374a0c08:

    # "Sydney reaches out and pulls the gun away from Carl as he looks it over, grinning."
    "O Sydney estica o braço e puxa a arma do Carl enquanto a examina, sorrindo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:409
translate ptbr carltuesday_9ae3517f:

    # "Jim" "\"HEY!\""
    "Jim" "\"EI!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:410
translate ptbr carltuesday_51f53229:

    # "Suddenly, the screen switches back to the file menu and we both sit there in silence for a few seconds."
    "De repente, a tela volta pro menu de arquivos e nós dois ficamos sentados em silêncio por alguns segundos."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:412
translate ptbr carltuesday_ad09ad0c:

    # c "\"Sorry, I—I guess I forgot that...\""
    c "\"Desculpa, eu... eu acho que esqueci que...\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:413
translate ptbr carltuesday_32f69c29:

    # "Of course Sydney was going to be at that party, but I'd honestly forgotten, too."
    "Claro que o Sydney estaria naquela festa, mas eu honestamente tinha esquecido também."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:414
translate ptbr carltuesday_b79d4388:

    # "If there was any way to perfectly ruin the mood, that had been it."
    "Se tinha algum jeito de arruinar o clima perfeitamente, tinha sido esse."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:415
translate ptbr carltuesday_5be0fc09:

    # "I glance over at Carl and see him looking down at the game pad, ears lowered, the insides red."
    "Eu olho de relance pro Carl e o vejo olhando pra baixo pro controle, orelhas abaixadas, a parte de dentro vermelha."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:416
translate ptbr carltuesday_7b19bad1:

    # m "\"Hey, it's okay. I mean, maybe it's a good thing to watch—\""
    m "\"Ei, tá tudo bem. Quer dizer, talvez seja uma boa coisa de se assistir—\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:417
translate ptbr carltuesday_f86fc60e:

    # c "\"My dad, I didn't know he'd say that. I'd rather not find out what else he's said.\""
    c "\"O meu pai, eu não sabia que ele ia dizer isso. Eu prefiro não descobrir o que mais ele disse.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:418
translate ptbr carltuesday_5d265817:

    # m "\"Oh, yeah...\""
    m "\"Ah, é...\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:419
translate ptbr carltuesday_975a52f2:

    # "I look around, trying to find something, anything to distract us from what just happened."
    "Eu olho ao redor, tentando achar alguma coisa, qualquer coisa pra nos distrair do que acabou de acontecer."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:420
translate ptbr carltuesday_ba6f124b:

    # "My eyes fall on the shelves holding Carl's game library."
    "Meus olhos caem nas prateleiras com a biblioteca de jogos do Carl."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:421
translate ptbr carltuesday_b7c538fb:

    # m "\"...Wanna play a game?\""
    m "\"...Quer jogar um jogo?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:425
translate ptbr carltuesday_a1582ce0:

    # "It's just like old times as we co-op through Winter Castle."
    "É igualzinho aos velhos tempos enquanto jogamos co-op em Winter Castle."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:426
translate ptbr carltuesday_907895db:

    # "The fact that he still has the old save files from when he was in college makes it all the more nostalgic."
    "O fato dele ainda ter os arquivos salvos de quando ele tava na faculdade deixa tudo ainda mais nostálgico."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:427
translate ptbr carltuesday_69c0e83a:

    # "I get so into it that it gets dark outside without me even knowing, and pretty soon I'm looking out at the purple sky reluctantly."
    "Eu fico tão focado naquilo que escurece lá fora sem que eu nem perceba, e logo tô olhando pro céu roxo com relutância."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:428
translate ptbr carltuesday_8ea35f41:

    # m "\"About time I go back.\""
    m "\"Tá na hora de eu voltar.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:429
translate ptbr carltuesday_b9a8a15e:

    # "Carl sighs and pauses the game before stretching and dropping the controller onto his bed."
    "O Carl suspira e pausa o jogo antes de se alongar e jogar o controle na cama dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:431
translate ptbr carltuesday_45a268f5:

    # c "\"Aww, come on. Sure you can't stick around?\""
    c "\"Aah, qual é. Tem certeza de que não pode ficar mais?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:432
translate ptbr carltuesday_cb4d7a70:

    # m "\"I dunno. I don't have any clothes, or toothbrush...\""
    m "\"Eu não sei. Eu não tenho roupa nenhuma, ou escova de dente...\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:433
translate ptbr carltuesday_6916f269:

    # c "\"We can walk over and get them.\""
    c "\"A gente pode ir andando até lá e pegar.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:434
translate ptbr carltuesday_3170a6c2:

    # "Carl seems pretty determined to make me stay, and there's not one reason why I can't, so I relent."
    "O Carl parece bem determinado em me fazer ficar, e não tem nenhuma razão pra eu não poder, então eu cedo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:435
translate ptbr carltuesday_300d4356:

    # m "\"Alright...Yeah, this could be fun.\""
    m "\"Tá bom... É, isso pode ser divertido.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:437
translate ptbr carltuesday_afd5eb69:

    # c "\"Yes!\""
    c "\"Isso!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:438
translate ptbr carltuesday_027f47a5:

    # "Carl looks happy and almost relieved."
    "O Carl parece feliz e quase aliviado."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:439
translate ptbr carltuesday_594a8b34:

    # c "\"It'll be just like old times!\""
    c "\"Vai ser igualzinho aos velhos tempos!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:440
translate ptbr carltuesday_1a81d070:

    # "He rolls to his hooves."
    "Ele rola e fica de pé nos cascos."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:441
translate ptbr carltuesday_99a354a3:

    # c "\"And speaking of old times, let's make a pizza!\""
    c "\"E falando de velhos tempos, vamo fazer uma pizza!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:442
translate ptbr carltuesday_35c842d0:

    # "I've suddenly caught Carl's enthusiasm."
    "Eu de repente peguei o entusiasmo do Carl."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:444
translate ptbr carltuesday_0f7bc954:

    # "We go into the massive kitchen and pull a big frozen pizza from the fridge and, while it bakes, we sit at the counter and talk."
    "A gente vai pra cozinha gigantesca e tira uma pizza grande congelada da geladeira e, enquanto ela assa, nós sentamos no balcão e conversamos."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:445
translate ptbr carltuesday_f944daad:

    # "At this point the haze of pot has lifted from Carl's face and he's animated and excited again, swiveling on one of the counter stools."
    "A essa altura, a névoa da maconha já saiu do rosto do Carl e ele tá animado e empolgado de novo, girando em um dos bancos do balcão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:446
translate ptbr carltuesday_a2ea130c:

    # "For the first time in almost ten years I'm giddy and excited in the way you only get when you're at a sleepover."
    "Pela primeira vez em quase dez anos, eu tô tonto e empolgado do jeito que você só fica quando tá numa festa do pijama."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:447
translate ptbr carltuesday_31487b3a:

    # "That makes it a little jarring when he pulls out some beers, but I'm happy to have a few and we guzzle them down as we talk about past sleepovers."
    "Isso deixa as coisas um pouco estranhas quando ele tira umas cervejas, mas eu fico feliz de tomar algumas e a gente vira elas enquanto conversamos sobre festas do pijama passadas."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:448
translate ptbr carltuesday_c178a489:

    # "Pretty soon our reminiscing drifts into the present and that's when the conversation slows a bit, Carl having less to say."
    "Logo as nossas lembranças derivam pro presente e é aí que a conversa desacelera um pouco, com o Carl tendo menos o que dizer."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:449
translate ptbr carltuesday_0bc8912d:

    # "I try to change the subject and tell him that he should come back to school."
    "Eu tento mudar de assunto e digo a ele que ele devia voltar pra escola."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:450
translate ptbr carltuesday_d60407dc:

    # "He just smiles and shakes his head."
    "Ele só sorri e balança a cabeça."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:456
translate ptbr carltuesday_32dd5ceb:

    # "Three hours later, we're both laying back on Carl's bed, head to toe, having just watched a shitty action movie."
    "Três horas depois, a gente tá deitado de costas na cama do Carl, com as cabeças apontando pro pé um do outro, tendo acabado de assistir um filme de ação merda."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:457
translate ptbr carltuesday_651fc380:

    # "We didn't end up going out to get my stuff, so I'm just in my boxers, pleasantly drowsy and buzzed."
    "A gente acabou não indo pegar as minhas coisas, então eu tô só de cueca, agradavelmente sonolento e meio alto."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:458
translate ptbr carltuesday_c44561bc:

    # "I hear Carl snuffle and look down my chest at him."
    "Eu ouço o Carl dar uma fungada e olho por cima do meu peito pra ele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:459
translate ptbr carltuesday_b78c5883:

    # m "\"What's up?\""
    m "\"O que foi?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:460
translate ptbr carltuesday_68ba5dd2:

    # "He looks over at me and shrugs."
    "Ele olha pra mim e dá de ombros."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:462
translate ptbr carltuesday_e4c31812:

    # c "\"Nothin', just thinkin'\""
    c "\"Nada, só pensando\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:463
translate ptbr carltuesday_222deb2c:

    # m "\"What about?\""
    m "\"Em quê?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:465
translate ptbr carltuesday_007162fb:

    # "During our past sleepovers Carl had always been afraid to be the last to fall asleep."
    "Durante as nossas festas do pijama passadas, o Carl sempre teve medo de ser o último a dormir."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:466
translate ptbr carltuesday_9795e26a:

    # "He'd try to keep me up by talking, rolling over on top of me...and sometimes by just throwing shit at me."
    "Ele tentava me manter acordado conversando, rolando em cima de mim... e às vezes só jogando merda em mim."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:467
translate ptbr carltuesday_0f81690e:

    # "I wonder if that's what he's doing now."
    "Eu me pergunto se é isso que ele tá fazendo agora."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:468
translate ptbr carltuesday_03fd6a6f:

    # c "\"I dunno...life?\""
    c "\"Sei lá... a vida?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:469
translate ptbr carltuesday_493373c6:

    # m "\"That's a lot to think about.\""
    m "\"É muita coisa pra se pensar.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:470
translate ptbr carltuesday_88b91b5e:

    # c "\"Not for me, heh.\""
    c "\"Não pra mim, heh.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:471
translate ptbr carltuesday_a1be1a76:

    # "I look over at him again."
    "Eu olho pra ele de novo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:472
translate ptbr carltuesday_fa63385e:

    # "He's holding one paw up, looking through his fingers at the ceiling fan."
    "Ele tá segurando uma pata pra cima, olhando por entre os dedos pro ventilador de teto."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:473
translate ptbr carltuesday_4c324a57:

    # m "\"You're just figuring things out.\""
    m "\"Você só tá tentando descobrir as coisas.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:475
translate ptbr carltuesday_3ece6df8:

    # "Carl lets his arm flop back down over his head, blowing out a sigh."
    "O Carl deixa o braço cair frouxo de volta sobre a cabeça dele, soltando um suspiro."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:476
translate ptbr carltuesday_7e7feb00:

    # c "\"I'm not figuring things out, man.\""
    c "\"Eu não tô tentando descobrir as coisas, cara.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:477
translate ptbr carltuesday_73365198:

    # "I don't say anything. It's cool that he's reaching out to me, but I'm not sure I can offer any advice that he hasn't heard before."
    "Eu não digo nada. É legal ele tá se abrindo pra mim, mas não tenho certeza se consigo dar algum conselho que ele já não tenha ouvido antes."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:478
translate ptbr carltuesday_0a4f66a8:

    # c "\"I just...I just wish I could be doing something.\""
    c "\"Eu só... eu só queria poder tá fazendo alguma coisa.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:479
translate ptbr carltuesday_a3506f66:

    # "I think for a moment."
    "Eu penso por um momento."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:480
translate ptbr carltuesday_3cb1859f:

    # m "\"You've done a lot more than some people I know.\""
    "Você já fez muito mais do que algumas pessoas que eu conheço."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:481
translate ptbr carltuesday_2cc851af:

    # m "\"I mean, your art is great, you did go to school even if you dropped out, and you were working while you could.\""
    "Quer dizer, a sua arte é ótima, você foi pra faculdade, mesmo que tenha largado, e você trabalhou enquanto pôde."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:482
translate ptbr carltuesday_ee939324:

    # m "\"There are a lot of people out there who can't even say that.\""
    "Tem um monte de gente por aí que não pode nem dizer isso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:483
translate ptbr carltuesday_a846176f:

    # "Carl laughs, but it's a sad kind of laugh."
    "O Carl ri, mas é um tipo de risada triste."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:484
translate ptbr carltuesday_86df6a13:

    # c "\"Try saying that to my mom. She's always got something to do, always WANTS to do something.\""
    "Tenta dizer isso pra minha mãe. Ela sempre tem alguma coisa pra fazer, sempre QUER fazer alguma coisa."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:485
translate ptbr carltuesday_a0964f2f:

    # c "\"I just...I just don't feel that."
    "Eu só... eu só não sinto isso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:487
translate ptbr carltuesday_66c26247:

    # "He turns his head towards me."
    "Ele vira a cabeça pra mim."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:488
translate ptbr carltuesday_ec6c7849:

    # c "\"I {i}wish{/i} I did, Chase, but I just {i}can't{/i}.\""
    c "\"Eu {i}queria{/i} sentir, Chase, mas eu simplesmente {i}não consigo{/i}.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:489
translate ptbr carltuesday_f40e0cd8:

    # "His voice catches in his throat, and I shrink a bit into the bed and pretend not to notice."
    "A voz dele trava na garganta, e eu me encolho um pouco na cama e finjo que não notei."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:490
translate ptbr carltuesday_eac6f515:

    # "The beer we've had is definitely partly to blame for this."
    "A cerveja que tomamos com certeza é em parte culpada por isso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:491
translate ptbr carltuesday_fd9c598c:

    # "He turns his head towards the wall, though, and I'm guiltily relieved that when he talks again his voice is under control."
    "Ele vira o rosto pra parede, porém, e eu fico culpado de alívio por, quando ele fala de novo, a voz dele estar sob controle."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:492
translate ptbr carltuesday_deb50bb0:

    # c "\"I just wish it wasn't such a goddamn chore for me to just go outside, ya know?\""
    c "\"Eu só queria que não fosse uma tarefa tão chata pra caralho pra mim só sair de casa, sabe?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:493
translate ptbr carltuesday_00419bb5:

    # "I didn't know, but I nod anyway, even if he can't see."
    "Eu não sabia, mas eu aceno com a cabeça do mesmo jeito, mesmo ele não podendo ver."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:494
translate ptbr carltuesday_ba13d82e:

    # "He's waiting for me to say something, though, so I clear my throat."
    "Ele tá esperando eu falar alguma coisa, porém, então eu limpo a garganta."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:498
translate ptbr carltuesday_945d6ab3:

    # m "\"Don't take this the wrong way, but maybe you should see a therapist?\""
    m "\"Não leva pro lado pessoal, mas talvez você devesse ir num terapeuta?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:500
translate ptbr carltuesday_ca292873:

    # "He snorts and finally turns his head to look back at me, his horns bumping the wall loudly."
    "Ele bufa e finalmente vira a cabeça pra olhar pra mim de novo, os chifres dele batendo com força na parede."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:501
translate ptbr carltuesday_098b5d34:

    # c "\"Ha! I already do. I thought they'd just give me a pill to make things better, but apparently I have to actually make an effort, too.\""
    c "\"Ha! Eu já vou. Eu achava que eles iam só me dar uma pílula pra melhorar as coisas, mas pelo visto eu tenho que realmente fazer um esforço também.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:503
translate ptbr carltuesday_579b423c:

    # c "\"And I'm like, isn't that why I'm seeing you, for the whole 'making an effort' thing?\""
    c "\"E eu tipo, não é por isso que eu tô vindo te ver, por conta de toda essa parada de 'fazer um esforço'?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:504
translate ptbr carltuesday_875693dc:

    # "I laugh along with him."
    "Eu dou risada com ele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:505
translate ptbr carltuesday_02130f94:

    # m "\"Yeah, I can remember what that's like.\""
    m "\"É, eu consigo me lembrar de como é isso.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:507
translate ptbr carltuesday_71667f3c:

    # m "\"You know, Carl, some people are just like that.\""
    m "\"Sabe, Carl, algumas pessoas só são assim.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:509
translate ptbr carltuesday_056b97bb:

    # "He looks down at me, but doesn't say anything."
    "Ele olha pra mim, mas não fala nada."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:510
translate ptbr carltuesday_cc6f2f35:

    # m "\"If it's so hard to get out, then just don't.\""
    m "\"Se é tão difícil sair, então só não sai.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:511
translate ptbr carltuesday_f6fa1af8:

    # m "\"People figure things out, eventually. And if you always just want to stay home then do that.\""
    m "\"As pessoas dão um jeito nas coisas, eventualmente. E se você sempre quiser ficar em casa, então fica.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:512
translate ptbr carltuesday_b32c5b8e:

    # m "\"Just, uh, try to figure out a way to sustain yourself. That's pretty much the gist of what my therapist told me; do what makes you happy.\""
    m "\"Só, hã, tenta descobrir um jeito de se sustentar. É mais ou menos esse o resumo do que meu terapeuta me disse; faz o que te faz feliz.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:514
translate ptbr carltuesday_79822797:

    # "He watches me for a few seconds."
    "Ele me observa por alguns segundos."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:515
translate ptbr carltuesday_bc16c0e9:

    # c "\"So is all that.. are all those problems you had taken care of now?\""
    c ""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:516
translate ptbr carltuesday_118a2043:

    # m "\"I hope so.\""
    m "\"Espero que sim.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:517
translate ptbr carltuesday_162401d6:

    # "We lay in silence for a little while, before I finally speak up."
    "Nós ficamos deitados em silêncio por um tempinho, antes de eu finalmente falar."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:518
translate ptbr carltuesday_2b350497:

    # m "\"Listen, I'll probably come back a few times this week to work with that history stuff.\""
    m "\"Escuta, eu provavelmente vou voltar algumas vezes essa semana pra mexer com aquela parada de história.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:519
translate ptbr carltuesday_ee0ce558:

    # m "\"Well, why don't we go out and {i}do{/i} something?\""
    m "\"Então, por que a gente não sai e {i}faz{/i} alguma coisa?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:521
translate ptbr carltuesday_74e87039:

    # c "\"That would be nice...\""
    c "\"Isso seria legal...\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:522
translate ptbr carltuesday_173f9c64:

    # "I grin, glad at making Carl feel better."
    "Eu dou um sorriso, feliz por fazer o Carl se sentir melhor."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:523
translate ptbr carltuesday_c1230466:

    # m "\"Cool, let's plan on it.\""
    m "\"Beleza, vamo combinar isso.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:525
translate ptbr carltuesday_8feeeece:

    # "Carl puts his paws behind his head and smiles."
    "O Carl coloca as patas atrás da cabeça e sorri."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:526
translate ptbr carltuesday_fbf1158b:

    # c "\"It's cool that you're here, Chase.\""
    c "\"É legal você tá aqui, Chase.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:527
translate ptbr carltuesday_9b78e6b5:

    # m "\"It's cool to be here, Carl.\""
    m "\"É legal tá aqui, Carl.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:529
translate ptbr carltuesday_95b49665:

    # c "\"And not just because it's nice to have someone to talk to.\""
    c "\"E não só porque é legal ter alguém pra conversar.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:530
translate ptbr carltuesday_ba8d8248:

    # m "\"Oh?\""
    m "\"Ah é?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:532
translate ptbr carltuesday_def34b9f:

    # c "\"No. This house is fucking haunted.\""
    c "\"Não. Essa casa é mal-assombrada pra caralho.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:541
translate ptbr carltuesday_f56e2a17:

    # "I don't remember falling asleep, but it's at that moment that something wakes me up."
    "Eu não lembro de ter pegado no sono, mas é nesse momento que alguma coisa me acorda."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:542
translate ptbr carltuesday_e1bf2a59:

    # "I jolt, then lay there, trying to remember where I am."
    "Eu dou um pulo, aí fico deitado lá, tentando lembrar onde eu tô."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:543
translate ptbr carltuesday_b3083ba0:

    # "Carl's house, that's right."
    "Casa do Carl, é verdade."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:544
translate ptbr carltuesday_380246ce:

    # "I stare at the ceiling, wondering what time it is."
    "Eu encaro o teto, me perguntando que horas são."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:545
translate ptbr carltuesday_1be21769:

    # "I don't bother to look my phone, though, because I'm already starting to fall back asleep."
    "Eu não me dou ao trabalho de olhar meu celular, porém, porque já tô começando a pegar no sono de novo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:547
translate ptbr carltuesday_deac3191:

    # "A scraping noise from beneath me makes me jump and I prop myself up on my elbows, listening."
    "Um barulho de algo arranhando embaixo de mim me faz pular e eu me apoio nos meus cotovelos, escutando."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:548
translate ptbr carltuesday_9c5e5d2b:

    # "Looking over, I see Carl's staring at the ceiling, eyes wide."
    "Olhando, vejo o Carl encarando o teto, de olhos arregalados."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:549
translate ptbr carltuesday_74dba477:

    # m "\"Carl?\""
    m "\"Carl?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:550
translate ptbr carltuesday_865e78b6:

    # "I whisper it, and I'm not sure why."
    "Eu sussurro, e não tenho certeza do porquê."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:551
translate ptbr carltuesday_7d2d9d46:

    # "He jumps, then looks at me, confused, like he'd just woken up."
    "Ele dá um pulo, e então olha pra mim, confuso, como se tivesse acabado de acordar."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:553
translate ptbr carltuesday_f62c423b:

    # c "\"Huh?\""
    c "\"Hã?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:554
translate ptbr carltuesday_994f6c7b:

    # m "\"Are you okay?\""
    m "\"Você tá bem?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:555
translate ptbr carltuesday_b64050e5:

    # c "\"Yeah, what's wrong?\""
    c "\"Sim, o que foi?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:556
translate ptbr carltuesday_f4e5145e:

    # m "\"I—I think I hear something.\""
    m "\"E-eu acho que tô ouvindo alguma coisa.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:557
translate ptbr carltuesday_ce408c10:

    # "His floppy ears perk up."
    "As orelhas caídas dele se levantam."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:558
translate ptbr carltuesday_0295e8bd:

    # c "\"I don't—\""
    c "\"Eu não—\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:559
translate ptbr carltuesday_00843de4:

    # "Then his eyes widen."
    "Então os olhos dele se arregalam."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:560
translate ptbr carltuesday_29f7d9e6:

    # "Although I didn't hear anything right then, he definitely did."
    "Embora eu não tenha ouvido nada bem na hora, ele com certeza ouviu."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:561
translate ptbr carltuesday_73dabd7e:

    # m "\"You hear it?\""
    m "\"Cê tá ouvindo?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:562
translate ptbr carltuesday_4d24b8af:

    # c "\"Yeah, like a scraping noise I told you about?\""
    c "\"Tô, tipo um barulho de alguma coisa arranhando que eu te falei?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:563
translate ptbr carltuesday_ba9c3ac4:

    # m "\"Yeah!\""
    m "\"É!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:565
translate ptbr carltuesday_67ab9819:

    # "He looks happy."
    "Ele parece feliz."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:566
translate ptbr carltuesday_bc3e9be2:

    # c "\"Ha! So I'm not fucking crazy!\""
    c "\"Ha! Então eu não tô ficando maluco pra caralho!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:567
translate ptbr carltuesday_00512e69:

    # "We both sit there and listen for a while, but it sounds like it stopped."
    "Nós dois ficamos sentados lá e escutamos por um tempo, mas parece que parou."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:568
translate ptbr carltuesday_f31f1133:

    # c "\"Wanna go see what—\""
    c "\"Quer ir ver o que—\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:570
translate ptbr carltuesday_149cad05:

    # "Suddenly, his eyes widen and his muzzle drops open in shock."
    "De repente, os olhos dele se arregalam e o focinho se abre em choque."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:571
translate ptbr carltuesday_d9f08854:

    # "I stare back."
    "Eu o encaro de volta."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:572
translate ptbr carltuesday_486a0250:

    # m "\"What!?\""
    m "\"O quê!?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:573
translate ptbr carltuesday_a92d8650:

    # c "\"Did you fucking hear that!?\""
    c "\"Você escutou isso, porra!?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:574
translate ptbr carltuesday_24fc76d8:

    # "I listen, feeling my heartbeat pick up now that Carl looks fucking terrified...but I don't hear anything."
    "Eu escuto, sentindo meu batimento cardíaco acelerar agora que o Carl parece aterrorizado pra caralho... mas eu não ouço nada."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:575
translate ptbr carltuesday_486a0250_1:

    # m "\"What!?\""
    m "\"O quê!?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:577
translate ptbr carltuesday_be8c9704:

    # c "\"A fucking voice!\""
    c "\"Uma voz, porra!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:578
translate ptbr carltuesday_7d529342:

    # "The fur raises up all over my body as I listen."
    "O pelo se arrepia no meu corpo todo enquanto eu escuto."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:579
translate ptbr carltuesday_05eb986c:

    # "But nothing. Carl definitely seems convinced, though, so I listen harder."
    "Mas nada. O Carl com certeza parece convencido, porém, então eu escuto com mais atenção."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:580
translate ptbr carltuesday_c919a722:

    # "I just start to make out what might be a voice when Carl sits up next to me and gets out of bed."
    "Eu começo a distinguir o que pode ser uma voz quando o Carl se senta do meu lado e sai da cama."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:581
translate ptbr carltuesday_3c314115:

    # "I feel myself start to panic. Did some crazy hobo break into the house?"
    "Eu sinto que começo a entrar em pânico. Algum mendigo maluco invadiu a casa?"

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:583
translate ptbr carltuesday_2e7b49eb:

    # "Carl gets off the couch."
    "O Carl sai do sofá."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:584
translate ptbr carltuesday_9881db88:

    # c "\"Come on.\""
    c "\"Vem.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:585
translate ptbr carltuesday_d72ada8d:

    # m "\"What? What the fuck are we gonna do!? Let's call the cops!\""
    m "\"O quê? O que caralhos a gente vai fazer!? Vamo ligar pra polícia!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:586
translate ptbr carltuesday_087e6a14:

    # c "\"No, let's make sure, first. This has happened before.\""
    c "\"Não, vamos ter certeza primeiro. Isso já aconteceu antes.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:587
translate ptbr carltuesday_46cc8e5b:

    # m "\"What? What do you mean?\""
    m "\"O quê? Como assim?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:588
translate ptbr carltuesday_4fb48d76:

    # "He puts a finger up to his lips."
    "Ele coloca um dedo nos lábios."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:589
translate ptbr carltuesday_c69c73b8:

    # c "\"Grab something.\""
    c "\"Pega alguma coisa.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:590
translate ptbr carltuesday_df8ec4bc_1:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"O quê?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:592
translate ptbr carltuesday_601693b7:

    # "I follow Carl out into the kitchen and he starts rummaging through the drawers."
    "Eu sigo o Carl até a cozinha e ele começa a vasculhar as gavetas."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:593
translate ptbr carltuesday_443655bd:

    # "I follow him, hugging my shoulders, feeling a lot colder right now."
    "Eu o sigo, me abraçando, me sentindo bem mais frio agora."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:594
translate ptbr carltuesday_9113047b:

    # "With the sound of metal sliding against metal Carl pulls out a giant steak knife."
    "Com o som de metal deslizando contra metal, o Carl tira uma faca de carne gigante."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:595
translate ptbr carltuesday_7769cdb4:

    # m "\"What. The. Fuck!?\""
    m "\"Que. Porra. É. Essa!?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:596
translate ptbr carltuesday_c57602b8:

    # c "\"Dude, I've been hearing this shit for the past month and I've been too scared to go down there, but now with you here—\""
    c "\"Cara, eu tenho ouvido essa porra há um mês e tava com muito medo de ir lá embaixo, mas agora com você aqui—\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:597
translate ptbr carltuesday_f51a2c44:

    # "He flashes me a smile."
    "Ele dá um sorriso pra mim."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:598
translate ptbr carltuesday_afc7516f:

    # c "\"I'm gonna find out what the fuck this is.\""
    c "\"Eu vou descobrir que porra é essa.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:599
translate ptbr carltuesday_ecd71296:

    # c "\"Here.\""
    c "\"Toma.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:600
translate ptbr carltuesday_a89126c7:

    # "He reaches into a spot between the fridge and the wall and pulls out a broom before sticking it out to me."
    "Ele enfia a mão num espaço entre a geladeira e a parede e tira uma vassoura, antes de estendê-la pra mim."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:601
translate ptbr carltuesday_21ed01bf:

    # "I take it slowly."
    "Eu pego devagar."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:602
translate ptbr carltuesday_664a4835:

    # m "\"What the hell am I supposed to do with this?\""
    m "\"O que diabos eu devo fazer com isso?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:603
translate ptbr carltuesday_0d1e26c3:

    # c "\"Hit him. Come on!\""
    c "\"Bate nele. Vem!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:604
translate ptbr carltuesday_98495cf0:

    # "Carl starts down the stairs and I follow behind, holding the broomstick in front of me like a sword."
    "O Carl começa a descer as escadas e eu o sigo, segurando o cabo de vassoura na minha frente como uma espada."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:605
translate ptbr carltuesday_a75a2683:

    # "I've never had to hit anyone with a stick before. I have no idea what I'm doing."
    "Eu nunca tive que bater em ninguém com um pau antes. Não tenho ideia do que tô fazendo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:608
translate ptbr carltuesday_92f0221e:

    # "Once we get to the small door leading down to the crawl space, Carl pauses and we both listen."
    "Assim que a gente chega na portinha que leva ao porão, o Carl para e nós dois escutamos."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:609
translate ptbr carltuesday_f70d859e:

    # "It's silent for a while, then—"
    "Fica em silêncio por um tempo, e então—"

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:611
translate ptbr carltuesday_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:612
translate ptbr carltuesday_5352251d:

    # m "\"Shit!\""
    m "\"Merda!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:613
translate ptbr carltuesday_3a664c15:

    # "Carl looks at me like I'm crazy, not reacting to the noise at all."
    "O Carl olha pra mim como se eu fosse louco, sem reagir ao barulho nem um pouco."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:614
translate ptbr carltuesday_6df00292:

    # c "\"Shh!\""
    c "\"Shh!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:615
translate ptbr carltuesday_32f80123:

    # "He leans down, a paw on the handle."
    "Ele se inclina, com uma pata na maçaneta."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:616
translate ptbr carltuesday_4969b682:

    # "Looking back at me, he signals me with his eyes to be ready."
    "Olhando de volta pra mim, ele sinaliza com os olhos pra eu me preparar."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:617
translate ptbr carltuesday_5b70a648:

    # "I grip onto the broom like a lifeline as I wait for him to swing the door open and, when he does—"
    "Eu me agarro à vassoura como se minha vida dependesse disso enquanto espero ele escancarar a porta, e quando ele o faz—"

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:621
translate ptbr carltuesday_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:622
translate ptbr carltuesday_c58b41a1:

    # "Darkness."
    "Escuridão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:624
translate ptbr carltuesday_732fa74e:

    # c "\"Shit.\""
    c "\"Merda.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:625
translate ptbr carltuesday_de74a55f:

    # "So whatever's down here is just slinking around in complete darkness?"
    "Então o que quer que esteja aqui embaixo tá se esgueirando na escuridão total?"

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:626
translate ptbr carltuesday_9a2f822c:

    c "\"E-ei!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:627
translate ptbr carltuesday_0aeb1ca9:

    # "Carl says it unconvincingly, the fear clear in his voice."
    "O Carl diz sem convicção, com o medo claro na voz dele."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:629
translate ptbr carltuesday_24ded373:

    # "Then, after looking back at me-"
    "Então, depois de olhar de volta pra mim-"

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:630
translate ptbr carltuesday_e2752b72:

    # c "\"Fuck it.\""
    c "\"Foda-se.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:632
translate ptbr carltuesday_43f2905b:

    # "He jumps down into the crawl space, disappearing into the dark."
    "Ele pula pra dentro do porão, desaparecendo na escuridão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:633
translate ptbr carltuesday_48aa6cc4:

    # m "\"Carl!\""
    m "\"Carl!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:634
translate ptbr carltuesday_812b36a7:

    # "I stumble up to the edge of the steps, trying to squint into the black."
    "Eu tropeço até a beira dos degraus, apertando os olhos tentando enxergar no escuro."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:635
translate ptbr carltuesday_b97ebe2a:

    # "I hear Carl to the right, rustling around and cursing."
    "Eu ouço o Carl pra direita, farfalhando por lá e xingando."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:639
translate ptbr carltuesday_a5bc5038:

    # "That's when light floods the crawl space."
    "É aí que a luz inunda o porão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:640
translate ptbr carltuesday_513e2590:

    # "I quickly wobble down the steps, knowing that if whatever is down here is gonna try to escape, it would be running right into me."
    "Eu cambaleio degraus abaixo rapidamente, sabendo que, se o que quer que esteja aqui embaixo tentar escapar, vai dar de cara comigo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:641
translate ptbr carltuesday_9c77adf1:

    # "Finally, I have a moment to catch my breath, standing several feet behind Carl as I look around, broom at the ready."
    "Finalmente, tenho um momento pra recuperar o fôlego, ficando a vários metros atrás do Carl enquanto olho ao redor, com a vassoura a postos."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:642
translate ptbr carltuesday_d4e30e5c:

    # c "\"There's nothing here...what the fuck?\""
    c "\"Não tem nada aqui... que porra é essa?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:643
translate ptbr carltuesday_48e32bd2:

    # "Sure enough, the crawl space looks empty. There aren't many places to hide, either."
    "E de fato, o porão parece vazio. Não há muitos lugares pra se esconder, também."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:644
translate ptbr carltuesday_de257664:

    # m "\"What the hell's going on, Carl?\""
    m "\"Que diabos tá acontecendo, Carl?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:645
translate ptbr carltuesday_0a692c0f:

    # "But he doesn't answer me. He's staring at the bins."
    "Mas ele não me responde. Tá encarando as caixas."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:646
translate ptbr carltuesday_d5f4c346:

    # c "\"Did you put the bins back?\""
    c "\"Você guardou as caixas de novo?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:647
translate ptbr carltuesday_52adc5ec:

    # "I look down, and the bins are gone."
    "Eu olho pra baixo, e as caixas sumiram."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:648
translate ptbr carltuesday_5461856a:

    # "I look back at where they were originally, and sure enough, they're neatly stacked right where we found them."
    "Eu olho pra onde elas tavam originalmente, e de fato, elas tão empilhadas direitinho bem onde nós as encontramos."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:649
translate ptbr carltuesday_9046708a:

    # m "\"I—\""
    m "\"Eu—\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:650
translate ptbr carltuesday_c13a42ec:

    # "I honestly don't remember. Did I move them back? Maybe, it would be something I might do. I try, but I just can't remember."
    "Eu honestamente não lembro. Fui eu que guardei? Talvez, é o tipo de coisa que eu faria. Eu tento, mas não consigo lembrar."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:651
translate ptbr carltuesday_543c8b0a:

    # m "\"Maybe...\""
    m "\"Talvez...\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:652
translate ptbr carltuesday_6ea50583:

    # c "\"Dude, come on.\""
    c "\"Mano, qual é.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:653
translate ptbr carltuesday_5f9c6c61:

    # m "\"I really don't remember!\""
    m "\"Eu realmente não lembro!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:654
translate ptbr carltuesday_532d6b68:

    # "Carl walks further towards the back, ears perked, looking left and right as he clutches his knife."
    "O Carl anda mais pro fundo, de orelhas em pé, olhando pra esquerda e pra direita enquanto segura a faca."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:655
translate ptbr carltuesday_1aa02a9d:

    # "I start to follow, but that's when I notice something at the left of my vision, on the ground."
    "Eu começo a segui-lo, mas é aí que percebo algo à esquerda do meu campo de visão, no chão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:656
translate ptbr carltuesday_069abfc6:

    # "Looking down, I see something fat and hairy ambling slowly over the tarp."
    "Olhando pra baixo, eu vejo algo gordo e peludo caminhando lentamente sobre a lona."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:657
translate ptbr carltuesday_7d8d8ce2:

    # "A giant fucking tarantula."
    "Uma caranguejeira gigante, porra."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:658
translate ptbr carltuesday_6e9ce21d:

    # "The following few moments are a blur, but the next thing I know I'm going up the stairs on my feet and paws, grabbing at the door frame to pull myself up."
    "Os momentos seguintes são um borrão, mas a próxima coisa de que me lembro é de estar subindo as escadas de quatro, me agarrando no batente da porta pra me puxar pra cima."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:660
translate ptbr carltuesday_7d104057:

    # c "\"Chase, what happened!?\""
    c "\"Chase, o que aconteceu!?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:662
translate ptbr carltuesday_9632f740:

    # "I can hear him running up behind me, so I turn to warn him."
    "Eu o ouço correndo atrás de mim, então me viro pra avisá-lo."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:663
translate ptbr carltuesday_c538351d:

    # m "\"L—look out. A big-a big spider!\""
    m "\"C-cuidado. Uma-uma aranha enorme!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:664
translate ptbr carltuesday_2916bec2:

    # "The breath keeps catching in my throat. I think I'm hyperventilating."
    "A respiração continua travando na garganta. Eu acho que tô hiperventilando."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:665
translate ptbr carltuesday_ab7a1b97:

    # "I'm still clutching at the door frame as Carl follows up behind me, his eyes wide."
    "Eu ainda tô me segurando no batente da porta enquanto o Carl me segue, de olhos arregalados."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:666
translate ptbr carltuesday_3002ad82:

    # c "\"Wha-come on Chase, this is crazy.\""
    c "\"Que-qual é, Chase, isso é loucura.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:667
translate ptbr carltuesday_263a4a83:

    # m "\"No, huge—a blond!\""
    m "\"Não, enorme—uma loira!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:668
translate ptbr carltuesday_9847a57e:

    # c "\"No fucking way!\""
    c "\"Mentira, porra!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:669
translate ptbr carltuesday_353203e1:

    # "Now he looks excited and he turns back to the crawl space."
    "Agora ele parece animado e se vira de volta pro porão."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:670
translate ptbr carltuesday_77c1b286:

    # "I feel numb right now. This is all too much to handle. What the fuck is even going on?"
    "Eu me sinto entorpecido agora. Isso é demais pra eu lidar. Que porra que tá acontecendo?"

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:671
translate ptbr carltuesday_5139b031:

    # c "\"Which way!?\""
    c "\"Pra que lado!?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:672
translate ptbr carltuesday_eed17937:

    # "Shakily, I point towards where the spider was crawling."
    "Trêmulo, eu aponto pra onde a aranha tava andando."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:673
translate ptbr carltuesday_8c07e196:

    # "Carl squints, then walks down the steps, looking around."
    "O Carl aperta os olhos, e então desce as escadas, olhando ao redor."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:675
translate ptbr carltuesday_7cb358f3:

    # m "\"Careful!\""
    m "\"Cuidado!\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:676
translate ptbr carltuesday_1c11f95f:

    # c "\"If it was really a blond there's not much to worry about. I hear they're actually pretty gentle.\""
    c "\"Se for mesmo uma loira não tem muito com o que se preocupar. Eu ouvi dizer que na verdade elas são bem mansas.\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:677
translate ptbr carltuesday_a54c8f60:

    # "I gulp and don't say anything."
    "Eu engulo em seco e não falo nada."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:678
translate ptbr carltuesday_7f684a79:

    # "My head is pounding and buzzing which, for some reason, doesn't exactly feel like it has anything to do with the adrenaline rush."
    "Minha cabeça tá latejando e zumbindo o que, por algum motivo, não parece ter nada a ver com a onda de adrenalina."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:679
translate ptbr carltuesday_a43eea92:

    # "It's more like a bad headache."
    "Parece mais com uma dor de cabeça forte."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:680
translate ptbr carltuesday_8cac4368:

    # "Carl looks around a while longer while I focus on the steps, making sure nothing starts crawling up them."
    "O Carl olha em volta por mais um tempo enquanto eu foco nos degraus, me certificando de que nada vai começar a rastejar por eles."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:681
translate ptbr carltuesday_7d3750a4:

    # "I don't even care about the possible hobo anymore."
    "Eu não ligo nem pro possível mendigo mais."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:683
translate ptbr carltuesday_56321c73:

    # "Finally, Carl comes back, looking confused."
    "Finalmente, o Carl volta, parecendo confuso."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:684
translate ptbr carltuesday_db88df25:

    # c "\"Well, there's nothing there. You know, sometimes I see shit when I'm really tired. Wanna go back upstairs?\""
    c "\"Bem, não tem nada lá. Sabe, às vezes eu vejo merda quando eu tô muito cansado. Quer voltar lá pra cima?\""

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:685
translate ptbr carltuesday_4367dae0:

    # "There's nothing there."
    "Não tem nada lá."

# game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:686
translate ptbr carltuesday_8be6997d:

    # "This can't be happening again..."
    "Isso não pode estar acontecendo de novo..."

translate ptbr strings:

    # game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:495
    old "You have a problem."
    new "Você tem um problema."

    # game/Carl-Tuesday.rpy:495
    old "It's fine."
    new "Tá tudo bem."

